bol-logo-lg-1.png\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:6:\"AIOSEO\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:18:\"https://aioseo.com\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:5:\"width\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:2:\"32\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:6:\"height\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:2:\"32\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}}s:4:\"item\";a:10:{i:0;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:73:\"\n		\n		\n					\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n\n					\n										\n					\n					\n			\n		\n		\n			\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:5:{s:0:\"\";a:7:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:74:\"Our OpenAI Integration Just Got 10x More Affordable – Now Using ChatGPT!\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:202:\"https://aioseo.com/our-openai-integration-just-got-10x-more-affordable-now-using-chatgpt/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=our-openai-integration-just-got-10x-more-affordable-now-using-chatgpt\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:98:\"https://aioseo.com/our-openai-integration-just-got-10x-more-affordable-now-using-chatgpt/#comments\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Thu, 16 Mar 2023 17:30:48 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:4:\"Blog\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:28:\"https://aioseo.com/?p=168649\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:497:\"<p>At AIOSEO, we are always looking for ways to improve our product and make SEO easier for everyone. Last week we announced our brand new OpenAI integration to help you generate high-quality SEO titles and meta descriptions. And just like&#8230;</p>\nThe post <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/our-openai-integration-just-got-10x-more-affordable-now-using-chatgpt/\">Our OpenAI Integration Just Got 10x More Affordable – Now Using ChatGPT!</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com\">AIOSEO</a>.\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:14:\"Benjamin Rojas\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:5922:\"<p>At AIOSEO, we are always looking for ways to improve our product and make SEO easier for everyone. Last week we <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/dominate-search-rankings-with-aioseos-ai-title-description-generator/\" title=\"Dominate Search Rankings with AIOSEO’s AI Title/Description Generator\">announced our brand new OpenAI integration</a> to help you generate high-quality SEO titles and meta descriptions.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>And just like that, we&#8217;ve made it even better!</p>\n\n\n\n<p>We listened to your feedback and heard that you wanted to get <strong>better results at a lower cost</strong>. Today I&#8217;m happy to announce that as of AIOSEO Pro 4.3.3, we made the switch to <strong>ChatGPT</strong> for our AI Title/Description Generator.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Switching to ChatGPT will provide better results at a fraction of the cost! The new API is 10x cheaper than the original Davinci model.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>With the integration of ChatGPT, we are confident that you will be able to generate SEO metadata even more efficiently and effectively than before and rank higher in search results.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>So, what does this mean for you? Let&#8217;s dive in&#8230;</p>\n\n\n\n<h2>Easily Craft High-Quality Post Titles and Meta Descriptions</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>With this latest update, <strong>nothing changes for you at all</strong>. Our brand new AI Title/Description Generator still takes the labor out of crafting post titles and meta descriptions, and all with just the click of a button!</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"699\" height=\"353\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/seo-title-generator-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-165754\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/seo-title-generator-1.png 699w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/seo-title-generator-1-300x152.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/seo-title-generator-1-600x303.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/seo-title-generator-1-119x60.png 119w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/seo-title-generator-1-178x90.png 178w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 699px) 100vw, 699px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Simply click on the robot icon that&#8217;s embedded in the <strong>Post Title</strong> and <strong>Meta Description</strong> fields. The integration with OpenAI will take it the rest of the way and generate 5 high-quality suggestions based on your content.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Here&#8217;s an example where we generated suggestions for our post about adding box shadows in WordPress:</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"378\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-165755\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results.jpeg 700w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-300x162.jpeg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-600x324.jpeg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-111x60.jpeg 111w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-167x90.jpeg 167w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>After that, just click on the plus button to add your preferred suggestion directly to the SEO meta fields.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"699\" height=\"168\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-2.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-165756\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-2.jpeg 699w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-2-300x72.jpeg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-2-600x144.jpeg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-2-190x46.jpeg 190w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-2-374x90.jpeg 374w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 699px) 100vw, 699px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>You can always edit the suggestion afterward if you need to adjust it.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2>Transform Your SEO Strategy with the AI Title/Description Generator</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>With our new AI Title/Description Generator, generating engaging SEO post titles and meta descriptions is just a click away! This powerful tool saves you time and ensures that your metadata is optimized for search engines and users.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>For those with a lot of content to update, manually updating post titles and meta descriptions on hundreds of pages can be daunting. But with our new AI Title/Description Generator, this task is accomplished effortlessly and efficiently, providing you with optimized content that has a better chance of ranking higher and generating more clicks.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Don&#8217;t miss out on this essential tool for your SEO needs. Check out our product <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/changelog/\" title=\"AIOSEO Changelog\">changelog</a> to see the other notable improvements we&#8217;ve made to many features you love.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>As a reminder, our ChatGPT OpenAI integration is available in AIOSEO Pro 4.3.3. We encourage all our users to upgrade today and take advantage of this fantastic feature.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>We are committed to providing our users with the best possible service, and this change is just one example of how we are continuously working to improve our product.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Thank you for choosing AIOSEO for your SEO needs. We look forward to helping you succeed in your online endeavors!</p>\n\n\n\n<p><em>-Benjamin Rojas (President of AIOSEO).</em></p>The post <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/our-openai-integration-just-got-10x-more-affordable-now-using-chatgpt/\">Our OpenAI Integration Just Got 10x More Affordable – Now Using ChatGPT!</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com\">AIOSEO</a>.\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:36:\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\";a:1:{s:10:\"commentRss\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:94:\"https://aioseo.com/our-openai-integration-just-got-10x-more-affordable-now-using-chatgpt/feed/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:38:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\";a:1:{s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:1:\"1\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:1;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:85:\"\n		\n		\n					\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n\n					\n										\n					\n					\n			\n		\n		\n			\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:5:{s:0:\"\";a:7:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:57:\"What is the Google Guaranteed Badge for Local Businesses?\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:176:\"https://aioseo.com/what-is-the-google-guaranteed-badge-for-local-businesses/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=what-is-the-google-guaranteed-badge-for-local-businesses\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:84:\"https://aioseo.com/what-is-the-google-guaranteed-badge-for-local-businesses/#respond\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Thu, 16 Mar 2023 14:05:30 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:5:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:4:\"Blog\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:8:\"SEO Tips\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:23:\"Google Guaranteed badge\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:21:\"Google Screened badge\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:9:\"local seo\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:28:\"https://aioseo.com/?p=166784\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:513:\"<p>Wondering what the Google Guaranteed program for local service-based businesses is? If you&#8217;ve searched on Google for local services you&#8217;ve probably seen ads at the top with a green checkmark next to the phrase &#8220;Google Guaranteed.&#8221; In this article we&#8217;ll&#8230;</p>\nThe post <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/what-is-the-google-guaranteed-badge-for-local-businesses/\">What is the Google Guaranteed Badge for Local Businesses?</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com\">AIOSEO</a>.\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:15:\"Sherrie Gossett\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:20432:\"<p>Wondering what the Google Guaranteed program for local service-based businesses is?</p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you&#8217;ve searched on Google for local services you&#8217;ve probably seen ads at the top with a green checkmark next to the phrase &#8220;Google Guaranteed.&#8221;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>In this article we&#8217;ll explain what the guarantee is and how you can get it for your business.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>We&#8217;ll start by taking a look at Google&#8217;s Local Services Ads. These are the ads that provide the &#8220;Google Guaranteed&#8221; promise.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group aioseo-table-of-contents has-theme-info-background-color has-background\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<p>In This Article</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-aioseo-table-of-contents\"><ul><li><a href=\"#aioseo-what-are-google-local-services-ads\">What are Google Local Services Ads?</a><ul></ul></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-what-is-the-google-screened-badge\">What is the Google Screened Badge?</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-what-is-the-google-guarantee-badge\">What is the Google Guaranteed Badge?</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-how-to-get-started-with-local-services-ads-and-become-google-guaranteed\">How to Get Started</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-how-to-set-up-your-local-seo\">How to Set Up Your Local SEO</a><ul></ul></li></ul></div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-what-are-google-local-services-ads\">What are Google Local Services Ads?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Google&#8217;s Local Services Ads (LSA) are lead generation ads that appear in local search results.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>They have a unique pricing set-up: you only pay per lead. This is different from PPC (pay-per-click) ads.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Searchers who see the ads can call you or send you a message directly through the ad.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>You only pay for the leads that come via the ad.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>In fact, Google allows you to dispute any contact that you think is not a qualified lead. And they&#8217;ll resolve the dispute within a week.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>These ads have several appealing elements:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>You can kick off the process quickly; it only takes minutes to fill out their form.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>You can start getting qualified leads even if you <a href=\"https://www.seedprod.com/coming-soon-pages-wordpress/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"\">don&#8217;t have a website set up yet</a>.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>You can appear at the top of local search results for related queries.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-screening-and-verification-process\">Background Check Process</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>After you fill out a short form with your business information, Google will run a background check on your business.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>This check will include the business owner(s) and any field workers who interact on-site with customers.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Any required business documents will be verified.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-what-is-the-google-screened-badge\">What is the Google Screened Badge?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>As part of the screening process, Google will do a business license check on service providers who are required to carry licenses. This includes lawyers and real estate agents.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"385\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-screened-local-services-ads-1024x385.jpg\" alt=\"local services ads google screened\" class=\"wp-image-162325\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-screened-local-services-ads-1024x385.jpg 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-screened-local-services-ads-300x113.jpg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-screened-local-services-ads-768x289.jpg 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-screened-local-services-ads-1536x578.jpg 1536w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-screened-local-services-ads-2048x771.jpg 2048w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-screened-local-services-ads-600x226.jpg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-screened-local-services-ads-159x60.jpg 159w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-screened-local-services-ads-239x90.jpg 239w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Ads that feature these licensed professionals will display a green checkmark next to the phrase &#8220;Google Screened.&#8221; And searchers can click to see the business&#8217;s license number.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-what-is-the-google-guarantee-badge\">What is the Google Guaranteed Badge?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The Google Guaranteed badge indicates that the advertised service provider has been screened and verified and they are backed by a <strong>financial guarantee</strong> offered by Google.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"612\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/2-local-services-ads-google-guaranteed-1-1024x612.png\" alt=\"local services ads google guaranteed example\" class=\"wp-image-162326\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/2-local-services-ads-google-guaranteed-1-1024x612.png 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/2-local-services-ads-google-guaranteed-1-300x179.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/2-local-services-ads-google-guaranteed-1-768x459.png 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/2-local-services-ads-google-guaranteed-1-1536x918.png 1536w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/2-local-services-ads-google-guaranteed-1-2048x1224.png 2048w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/2-local-services-ads-google-guaranteed-1-600x358.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/2-local-services-ads-google-guaranteed-1-100x60.png 100w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/2-local-services-ads-google-guaranteed-1-151x90.png 151w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>To be eligible for reimbursement,</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>The customer must procure the business&#8217;s service directly through a Local Services Ad.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The issue must be dissatisfaction with the <em>quality</em> of work, not dissatisfaction with responsiveness or other factors.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Reimbursement is up to Google&#8217;s sole discretion and may be up to the full amount paid for the service (subject to a &#8220;lifetime limit&#8221; cap).</p>\n\n\n\n<p>This lifetime limit caps vary between countries. For example, in the U.S. the cap is set at $2,000.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-how-to-get-started-with-local-services-ads-and-become-google-guaranteed\">How to Get Started With Local Services Ads and Become Google Guaranteed</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Follow the <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/what-are-local-services-ads/\" title=\"\">instructions here</a> to get up and running with Local Services Ads.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The process is easy:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>First, you&#8217;ll check your eligibility by seeing whether your particular service is listed.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Then you&#8217;ll fill out a short form with your business information.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>The Google team will follow up quickly with you.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Be sure to indicate that you are interested in being &#8220;Google Guaranteed&#8221; when you communicate with your ad representative.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-aioseo-theme-notice-box\" role=\"alert\">\n<p>The Google Guaranteed badge is sometimes referred to in articles as the &#8220;Google Guaranteed Program.&#8221;</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p>After Google completes the background check, you&#8217;ll choose your budget.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>In the meantime, you can set up your local SEO.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-how-to-set-up-your-local-seo\">How to Set Up Your Local SEO</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>To get started with local SEO, we recommend that you download and install the <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/pricing/\" title=\"\">All in One SEO (AIOSEO) plugin</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>This plugin makes technical SEO tasks as easy as clicking some buttons and filling a form out. Plus, it will give you recommendations for optimizing your content.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-download-the-all-in-one-seo-aioseo-plugin\">Download the All in One SEO (AIOSEO) Plugin</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>All in One SEO (AIOSEO) is an established WordPress plugin. It’s earned thousands of 5-star ratings on WordPress.org and is currently used by over 3 million people.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"485\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-1024x485.png\" alt=\"aioseo homepage\" class=\"wp-image-140989\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-1024x485.png 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-300x142.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-768x364.png 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-600x284.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-127x60.png 127w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-190x90.png 190w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage.png 1260w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>After downloading and <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/installing-all-in-one-seo-pro/\">installing</a> the plugin, a wizard will open and walk you through a few simple steps. These include:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Filling out some information about your website.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Adding your social media profile links.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 id=\"aioseo-add-your-business-information\">Add Your Business Information</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Next, in the top admin bar of your WordPress editor go to <strong>AIOSEO » Local SEO</strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"454\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-menu-1024x454.jpg\" alt=\"aioseo local seo menu\" class=\"wp-image-154766\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-menu-1024x454.jpg 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-menu-300x133.jpg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-menu-768x340.jpg 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-menu-1536x680.jpg 1536w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-menu-2048x907.jpg 2048w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-menu-600x266.jpg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-menu-135x60.jpg 135w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-menu-203x90.jpg 203w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Here you&#8217;ll fill in information about your business&#8217;s:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Location(s)</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Opening hours</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Google Maps information.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"478\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-settings-1024x478.png\" alt=\"aioseo local seo settings\" class=\"wp-image-154770\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-settings-1024x478.png 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-settings-300x140.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-settings-768x359.png 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-settings-600x280.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-settings-128x60.png 128w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-settings-193x90.png 193w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-settings.png 1353w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Note: For the latter, you&#8217;ll need to generate a Google API Key. Follow <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/setting-up-google-maps/\">these instructions</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 id=\"aioseo-whats-schema\">What&#8217;s Schema?</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>This local SEO process adds code called &#8220;schema&#8221; to your website. This helps Google to match your business to relevant search queries.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>This means Google can easily find and pull this information to display it as a &#8220;knowledge panel.&#8221; Here&#8217;s an example of a knowledge panel for a local business.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"637\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/local-business-knowledge-panel-1024x637.jpg\" alt=\"knowledge panel example\" class=\"wp-image-166792\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/local-business-knowledge-panel-1024x637.jpg 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/local-business-knowledge-panel-300x187.jpg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/local-business-knowledge-panel-768x478.jpg 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/local-business-knowledge-panel-1536x956.jpg 1536w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/local-business-knowledge-panel-2048x1275.jpg 2048w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/local-business-knowledge-panel-600x373.jpg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/local-business-knowledge-panel-96x60.jpg 96w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/local-business-knowledge-panel-145x90.jpg 145w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h4 id=\"aioseo-content-optimization\">Content Optimization</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>You can get recommendations in the plugin for optimizing your content so that it ranks better in search engine results.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Next, explore these SEO boosters:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>How to optimize your <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-check-if-your-google-search-snippets-are-properly-optimized/\" title=\"\">title tags and meta descriptions</a>. </li>\n\n\n\n<li>How to add <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-add-rich-snippets-to-wordpress/\">rich snippets</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-create-a-google-my-business-profile\">Create a Google My Business Profile</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>We also recommend creating a <a href=\"https://www.google.com/business/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">Google Business Profile</a>. Setting up a profile is an action that can improve your local SEO <a href=\"https://support.google.com/business/answer/7091?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">per Google</a>. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Once you&#8217;ve set it up, this profile will display to the right of Google search results for your business name.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"588\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/google-business-profile-example-1024x588.jpg\" alt=\"google business profile example\" class=\"wp-image-166796\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/google-business-profile-example-1024x588.jpg 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/google-business-profile-example-300x172.jpg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/google-business-profile-example-768x441.jpg 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/google-business-profile-example-600x344.jpg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/google-business-profile-example-105x60.jpg 105w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/google-business-profile-example-157x90.jpg 157w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/google-business-profile-example.jpg 1371w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><em>Google Business Profile displays look like knowledge panels, but they typically contain much more information.</em></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-aioseo-theme-notice-box\" role=\"alert\">\n<p>You can set up a Google Business Profile and use Local Services Ads even if your website <a href=\"https://www.seedprod.com/coming-soon-pages-wordpress/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"\">isn&#8217;t set up yet</a>.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-get-local-seo-citations\">Get Local SEO Citations</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Many small businesses can benefit from <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-get-local-seo-citations/\" title=\"local SEO citations\">local SEO citations</a>. These are listings in business directories and data aggregators.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>You only need listings in 1-4 data aggregators and a dozen or so of the top business directories. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Data aggregators will verify your business details, and other sites will begin to list your business once they see it’s been verified.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>However, it’s still a good idea to proactively submit your business to be listed on a dozen or so of the top directories.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>To get listed, you can use a low-cost service like <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/recommends/brightlocal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">BrightLocal.com</a> or WhiteSpark.com. Simply fill out a form, and they&#8217;ll handle the rest.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-benefits-of-citations\">Benefits of Citations</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>By having your business listed on authoritative sites, Google can see that your business details have been verified.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>These listings also add credibility to your online presence and boost your rankings. Seeing multiple citations of your business can influence potential customers too.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-which-service-businesses-are-eligible-for-local-services-ads\">Which Service Businesses are Eligible for Local Services Ads?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The service businesses eligible for Google&#8217;s Local Services Ads are listed below. Many involve home services or commercial building services. For example, the list includes plumbers, roofers, and electricians.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>However, there are also training services (beauty schools and driving instruction), animal rescue services, real estate agents, financial planners, and lawyers on the list.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Acupuncture</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Animal rescue services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Appliance repair</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Beauty school</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Carpentry</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Carpet cleaner</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Child care services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Countertop services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Dance instruction</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Dentistry</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Driving instruction</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Electrical</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Fencing</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Financial planning</li>\n\n\n\n<li>First aid training</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Flooring</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Foundations</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Funeral services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Garage door</li>\n\n\n\n<li>General contracting</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Handyman</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Home inspection</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Home security services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Home theater services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>House cleaning</li>\n\n\n\n<li>HVAC (Heating and Air Conditioning)</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Junk removal</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Landscaping</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Language instruction</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Law</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Lawn Care</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Locksmith</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Massage school</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Moving</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Personal training</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pest control</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pet adoption services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pet boarding</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pet grooming</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pet training</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Plumbing</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pool cleaning</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pool contractor</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Preschool</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Real estate</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Roofing</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sewage system services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Siding</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Snow removal services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tax services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tree services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tutoring</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Veterinary services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Water damage services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Weight loss services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Window cleaning</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-whats-next\">What’s Next?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>We hope this post helped you learn how the Google Guarantee works, and the role that local SEO and Local Services Ads can play in your digital marketing plans.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can also check out our article on how to <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-boost-your-small-business-seo/\">boost your SEO without expert help</a> and our complete <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/blog-post-seo-checklist/\">blog SEO checklist</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you found this article helpful, then please subscribe to our <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/AIOSEO\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">YouTube Channel</a>. You’ll find many more helpful tutorials there. You can also follow us on <a href=\"https://twitter.com/aioseopack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">Twitter</a>, <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/aioseo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">LinkedIn</a>, or <a href=\"https://facebook.com/aioseopack/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">Facebook</a> to stay in the loop.</p>The post <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/what-is-the-google-guaranteed-badge-for-local-businesses/\">What is the Google Guaranteed Badge for Local Businesses?</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com\">AIOSEO</a>.\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:36:\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\";a:1:{s:10:\"commentRss\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:81:\"https://aioseo.com/what-is-the-google-guaranteed-badge-for-local-businesses/feed/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:38:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\";a:1:{s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:1:\"0\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:2;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:88:\"\n		\n		\n					\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n\n					\n										\n					\n					\n			\n		\n		\n			\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:5:{s:0:\"\";a:7:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:45:\"The 6 Best AI SEO Tools for WordPress in 2023\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:126:\"https://aioseo.com/best-ai-seo-tools-for-wordpress/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=best-ai-seo-tools-for-wordpress\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:59:\"https://aioseo.com/best-ai-seo-tools-for-wordpress/#respond\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Mon, 13 Mar 2023 15:57:08 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:6:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:4:\"Blog\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:8:\"SEO Tips\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:9:\"AI in SEO\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:12:\"AI SEO tools\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:8:\"AI tools\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:14:\"best SEO tools\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:28:\"https://aioseo.com/?p=165762\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:428:\"<p>Looking for the best AI SEO tools for WordPress? Artificial intelligence (AI) and many other facets of the current digital revolution have resulted in a new crop of tools that can reduce the time required to perform certain tasks. One&#8230;</p>\nThe post <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/best-ai-seo-tools-for-wordpress/\">The 6 Best AI SEO Tools for WordPress in 2023</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com\">AIOSEO</a>.\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:11:\"Kato Nkhoma\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:20402:\"<p>Looking for the best AI SEO tools for WordPress?</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Artificial intelligence (AI) and many other facets of the current digital revolution have resulted in a new crop of tools that can reduce the time required to perform certain tasks. One industry that has benefitted from these technological advancements is the SEO industry.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>That’s why AI SEO tools are fast becoming the future of WordPress search engine optimization.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>In this article, we’ll show you some of the best AI SEO tools for your WordPress site.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group aioseo-table-of-contents has-theme-info-background-color has-background\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<p>In This Article</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-aioseo-table-of-contents\"><ul><li><a href=\"#aioseo-what-are-ai-seo-tools\">What are AI SEO tools?</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-the-best-ai-seo-tools-for-wordpress-our-expert-picks\">The Best AI SEO Tools for WordPress: Our Expert Picks</a><ul><li><a href=\"#aioseo-1-all-in-one-seo-aioseo\">1. All In One SEO (AIOSEO)</a><ul></ul></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-2-link-whisper\">2. Link Whisper</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-3-surferseo\">3. SurferSEO</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-4-wordlift\">4. WordLift</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-5-seopress\">5. SEOPress</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-6-rank-math\">6. Rank Math</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-the-best-ai-seo-tools-for-wordpress-our-top-pick\">The Best AI SEO Tools for WordPress: Our Top Pick</a></li></ul></div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-what-are-ai-seo-tools\">What are AI SEO tools?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>AI SEO tools use artificial intelligence (AI) to improve your workflow and efficiency when working on SEO-related tasks. Because they speed up the execution of tasks and improve efficiency, they help improve your rankings. As a result, your site will enjoy a greater influx of high-quality traffic.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Some of the aspects AI SEO tools help you with include:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Content creation and optimization</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Site analytics and optimization</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Market analysis</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Content planning and keyword research</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>The best AI SEO tools are easy to use and have excellent customer support. And for small businesses, they should come with an affordable price tag.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-the-best-ai-seo-tools-for-wordpress-our-expert-picks\">The Best AI SEO Tools for WordPress: Our Expert Picks</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Ready to supercharge your SEO?</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Here’s our expertly curated list of the best AI SEO tools to help you do that.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-1-all-in-one-seo-aioseo\">1. <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/pricing/\" title=\"Pricing\">All In One SEO</a> (AIOSEO)</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"311\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo.png\" alt=\"AIOSEO is the best AI SEO tool for WordPress.\" class=\"wp-image-151544\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo.png 700w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-300x133.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-600x267.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/pricing/\" title=\"Pricing\">AIOSEO</a> is a powerful yet easy-to-use SEO plugin that has been downloaded over 100 million times. Millions of smart business owners and marketers use it to help them boost their search engine rankings and drive qualified traffic to their sites.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Many small business owners and SEOs love AIOSEO because it has powerful features that help make SEO super easy. And some of them are powered by AI. We’ll look at 2 examples:</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 id=\"aioseo-ai-title-description-generator\">AI Title/Description Generator</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>AIOSEO’s <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/dominate-search-rankings-with-aioseos-ai-title-description-generator/\" title=\"[NEW] Dominate Search Rankings with AIOSEO’s AI Title/Description Generator\">AI Title/Description Generator</a> helps take the labor out of crafting post titles and meta descriptions as it automatically does this at a click of a button.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"699\" height=\"353\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/seo-title-generator-1.png\" alt=\"AIOSEO\'s AI Title/Description Generator is a powerful AI tool to help automate meta data writing.\" class=\"wp-image-165754\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/seo-title-generator-1.png 699w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/seo-title-generator-1-300x152.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/seo-title-generator-1-600x303.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/seo-title-generator-1-119x60.png 119w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/seo-title-generator-1-178x90.png 178w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 699px) 100vw, 699px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The AI engine then creates 5 suggestions based on your content…</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"378\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results.jpeg\" alt=\"The AI Title/Description Generator gives you 5 suggestions.\" class=\"wp-image-165755\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results.jpeg 700w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-300x162.jpeg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-600x324.jpeg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-111x60.jpeg 111w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-167x90.jpeg 167w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>All you need to do is select the one you want and tweak it if necessary.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>With optimized SEO post titles and meta descriptions, your content will:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Rank higher on search engines</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Gain more visibility on SERPs</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Drive more traffic to your site</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>And all it takes to gain these results is a simple click of a button!</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 id=\"aioseo-link-assistant\">Link Assistant</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Another AI-powered feature <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/features/internal-link-assistant/\" title=\"Link Assistant\">Link Assistant</a>, our AI-powered internal link building module.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Link Assistant <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/ways-link-assistant-can-save-you-time-on-internal-and-external-link-building/\" title=\"6 Ways Link Assistant Can Save You Time On Internal Link Building\">automates internal link building</a> by crawling your site to check for internal linking opportunities. The Overview shows you the number of external and internal links and the affiliate links on your site.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"329\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Divi-seo-link-assistant.png\" alt=\"Link Assistant is a handy feature that helps build internal links and boost yourSEO.\" class=\"wp-image-87481\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Divi-seo-link-assistant.png 700w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Divi-seo-link-assistant-300x141.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Divi-seo-link-assistant-600x282.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>You can also get a more detailed report of the links on your site by clicking on the <strong>Links Report</strong>. It then gives you a report with <strong>Linking Suggestions</strong> and shows you the <strong>Orphan Posts</strong> on your site.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"381\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/internal-linking-with-link-assistant-links-report.png\" alt=\"Link Assistant is a powerful tool that can help boost your internal linking strategy.\" class=\"wp-image-79017\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/internal-linking-with-link-assistant-links-report.png 700w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/internal-linking-with-link-assistant-links-report-300x163.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/internal-linking-with-link-assistant-links-report-600x327.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The best part is that you don’t even have to open the target page to add the suggested links. Instead, simply open the <strong>Links Report</strong> and click on a post or page. Doing so will open a window with internal inbound and internal outbound link suggestions.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"702\" height=\"316\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/link-assistant-adding-link.png\" alt=\"You can automatically add internal links using Link Assistant.\" class=\"wp-image-167487\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/link-assistant-adding-link.png 702w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/link-assistant-adding-link-300x135.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/link-assistant-adding-link-600x270.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/link-assistant-adding-link-133x60.png 133w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/link-assistant-adding-link-200x90.png 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 702px) 100vw, 702px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>This level of automation just makes the internal linking process faster and more efficient.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you’re looking for the best AI SEO tool for WordPress, then look no further than AIOSEO. Because it’s an easy-to-use plugin, you don’t need any coding or technical knowledge to use it to its full potential.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>For step-by-step instructions on how to install AIOSEO, check out our <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/installing-all-in-one-seo-pro/\" title=\"Installing All in One SEO Pro\">installation guide</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Pricing</strong>: Paid plans start at $49.60. A free plan is also available.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-2-link-whisper\">2. <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/recommends/linkwhisper/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"Link Whisper\">Link Whisper</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/recommends/linkwhisper/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"280\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-link-whisper.png\" alt=\"Link Whisper home page.\" class=\"wp-image-167488\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-link-whisper.png 700w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-link-whisper-300x120.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-link-whisper-600x240.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-link-whisper-150x60.png 150w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-link-whisper-225x90.png 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/recommends/linkwhisper/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"Link Whisper\">Link Whisper</a> is an AI-powered WordPress plugin designed to help you build strategic internal links. The plugin scans your draft in WordPress, finds relevant <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/posts-vs-pages-in-wordpress/\" title=\"Posts vs. Pages in WordPress — Everything You Need to Know\">posts and pages</a> on your site, and generates a list of suggestions for internal linking.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Like AIOSEO, the plugin displays suggested places to link to complete with editable anchor text. This enables you to automatically add internal links without opening the page in editor mode.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Pricing</strong>: $77 for a single-site license.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-3-surferseo\">3. <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/surferseo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"Surfer SEO\">SurferSEO</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/surferseo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"301\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-surfer-seo.png\" alt=\"Surfer SEO home page\" class=\"wp-image-167491\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-surfer-seo.png 700w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-surfer-seo-300x129.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-surfer-seo-600x258.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-surfer-seo-140x60.png 140w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-surfer-seo-209x90.png 209w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/surferseo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"Surfer SEO\">Surfer SEO</a> is an AI-powered on-page optimization tool that helps users ensure their content is primed for better ranking on search engine results pages (SERPs). The tool compares and analyzes top-ranking content on SERPs and gives you a report of the keywords you need to include in your content.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Besides content optimization, SurferSEO also generates outlines and content briefs optimized for SEO.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Pricing</strong>: Free. Paid plans start at $49/month.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-4-wordlift\">4. <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/wordlift/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"WordLift\">WordLift</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/wordlift/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"390\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-wordlift.png\" alt=\"WordLift home page\" class=\"wp-image-167492\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-wordlift.png 700w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-wordlift-300x167.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-wordlift-600x334.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-wordlift-108x60.png 108w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-wordlift-162x90.png 162w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/wordlift/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"WordLift\">Wordlift</a> is another AI SEO tool to consider for your WordPress site. It automatically adds structured data to your website so search engines can better understand your content. This also helps search engines generate a knowledge graph about your brand.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Other functions of WordLift include analyzing your content, classifying words into entities, and generating recommendations for optimizing your content. It also suggests images for your content, helps with internal linking, and more.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Pricing</strong>: €49/month (billed annually)</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-5-seopress\">5. <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/recommends/seopress/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"SEOPress\">SEOPress</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/recommends/seopress/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"702\" height=\"354\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-seopress.png\" alt=\"SEOPress home page\" class=\"wp-image-167493\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-seopress.png 702w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-seopress-300x151.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-seopress-600x303.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-seopress-119x60.png 119w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-ai-seo-tools-seopress-178x90.png 178w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 702px) 100vw, 702px\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/recommends/seopress/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"SEOPress\">SEOPress</a> is another WordPress SEO plugin powered by AI. The plugin&#8217;s straightforward setup makes it a great option for beginners. However, seasoned users will also find advanced controls to help them fine-tune their SEO.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>SEOPress has most of the features you’ll find in some of the <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/best-seo-plugins-for-wordpress/\" title=\"8 Best SEO Plugins for WordPress in 2023 (Tried and Tested)\">best WordPress SEO plugins</a>. Examples include open graph support, image and content XML sitemaps, redirects, and more.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Pricing</strong>: Paid plans start at $49/year.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-6-rank-math\">6. <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/recommends/rank-math/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"Rank Math\">Rank Math</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/recommends/rank-math/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"284\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-serp-preview-tools-rankmath.png\" alt=\"Rank Math home page\" class=\"wp-image-167494\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-serp-preview-tools-rankmath.png 700w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-serp-preview-tools-rankmath-300x122.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-serp-preview-tools-rankmath-600x243.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-serp-preview-tools-rankmath-148x60.png 148w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-serp-preview-tools-rankmath-222x90.png 222w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/recommends/rank-math/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"Rank Math\">Rank Math</a> is another WordPress SEO plugin with AI-powered features to help automate SEO tasks and increase efficiency.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Like AIOSEO, the plugin has an internal linking feature. However, Rank Math’s link builder isn’t automatic. It’s manual. Linking suggestions are shown in your WordPress content editor, and then you have to manually copy the suggested link and insert it into your text.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The plugin also has other SEO features like a schema generator, redirection manager, local SEO module, etc.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Pricing</strong>: Paid plans start at $59/year.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-the-best-ai-seo-tools-for-wordpress-our-top-pick\">The Best AI SEO Tools for WordPress: Our Top Pick</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/pricing/\" title=\"Pricing\">AIOSEO</a> is our top pick for the best AI SEO tool for WordPress. One reason is it’s a powerful plugin that’s super easy to use, making it an indispensable SEO tool. Plus, it has a feature set that enables you to DIY most aspects of your SEO so you can compete with big brands in your space.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>We hope this post helped you find the best AI SEO tool for your site. You may also want to check out other articles on our blog, like <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-start-a-small-business-blog/\" title=\"How to Start a Small Business Blog in 2023\">how to start a small business blog</a> or our tutorial on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-add-local-business-schema-in-wordpress/\" title=\"How to Add Local Business Schema in WordPress\">adding Local Business schema in WordPress.</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you found this article helpful, then please subscribe to our <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/AIOSEO\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">YouTube Channel</a>. You’ll find many more helpful tutorials there. You can also follow us on <a href=\"https://twitter.com/aioseopack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">Twitter</a>, <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/aioseo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">LinkedIn</a>, or <a href=\"https://facebook.com/aioseopack/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">Facebook</a> to stay in the loop.</p>The post <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/best-ai-seo-tools-for-wordpress/\">The 6 Best AI SEO Tools for WordPress in 2023</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com\">AIOSEO</a>.\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:36:\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\";a:1:{s:10:\"commentRss\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:56:\"https://aioseo.com/best-ai-seo-tools-for-wordpress/feed/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:38:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\";a:1:{s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:1:\"0\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:3;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:91:\"\n		\n		\n					\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n\n					\n										\n					\n					\n			\n		\n		\n			\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:5:{s:0:\"\";a:7:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:66:\"[SECURITY WARNING] Why You MUST Avoid “Free” AIOSEO Pro Nulled\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:132:\"https://aioseo.com/aioseo-pro-nulled-security-warning/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=aioseo-pro-nulled-security-warning\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:62:\"https://aioseo.com/aioseo-pro-nulled-security-warning/#respond\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Thu, 09 Mar 2023 14:14:51 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:7:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:4:\"Blog\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:8:\"Security\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:8:\"SEO News\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:13:\"AIOSEO nulled\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:17:\"AIOSEO Pro Nulled\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:21:\"All in One SEO Nulled\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:6;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:30:\"All in One SEO Pro Pack Nulled\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:28:\"https://aioseo.com/?p=166299\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:476:\"<p>Are you thinking about downloading an AIOSEO Pro nulled plugin? AIOSEO Pro nulled plugins are pirated copies of the popular All in One SEO (AIOSEO) WordPress plugin. Nulled plugins pose serious security risks, from installing backdoors to hijacking your site&#8230;</p>\nThe post <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/aioseo-pro-nulled-security-warning/\">[SECURITY WARNING] Why You MUST Avoid “Free” AIOSEO Pro Nulled</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com\">AIOSEO</a>.\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:15:\"Sherrie Gossett\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:30307:\"<p>Are you thinking about downloading an AIOSEO Pro nulled plugin?</p>\n\n\n\n<p>AIOSEO Pro nulled plugins are pirated copies of the popular All in One SEO (AIOSEO) WordPress plugin. Nulled plugins pose serious security risks, from installing backdoors to hijacking your site for criminal intent.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>In this article, we&#8217;ll explain why you need to avoid AIOSEO Pro nulled if you want to keep your blog and business website safe from hackers.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://aioseo.com/pricing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Try AIOSEO Pro Risk-Free</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:32px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group aioseo-table-of-contents has-theme-info-background-color has-background\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<p>In This Article</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-aioseo-table-of-contents\"><ul><li><a href=\"#aioseo-what-are-aioseo-pro-nulled-plugins\">What are AIOSEO Pro Nulled Plugins?</a><ul><li><a href=\"#aioseo-vulnerability-of-small-businesses\">Vulnerability of Small Businesses</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-security-threats-posed-by-aioseo-pro-nulled-plugins\">Security Threats Posed by AIOSEO Pro nulled Plugins</a><ul></ul></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-how-to-get-all-in-one-seo-aioseo-for-free\">How to Get AIOSEO for Free</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-all-in-one-seo-aioseo-pro-features\">AIOSEO Pro Features</a><ul></ul></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-how-to-get-a-aioseo-pro-license-key-free-aioseo-pro-latest-version\">How to Get a Pro License Key Free</a><ul></ul></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-summing-it-up\">Summary: Don&#8217;t Install AIOSEO Pro Nulled</a><ul></ul></li></ul></div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-what-are-aioseo-pro-nulled-plugins\">What are AIOSEO Pro Nulled Plugins?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>AIOSEO Pro nulled plugins are unauthorized, pirated copies of All in One SEO (AIOSEO) premium WordPress plugins.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>These nulled plugins (also called &#8220;cracked plugins&#8221;) are given away for free (or at a discount) on various websites.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>No websites offering AIOSEO Pro nulled plugins are affiliated with AIOSEO even though they use AIOSEO&#8217;s logo and features list.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Because these nulled plugins are unauthorized, site owners that install them are ineligible to receive support from All in One SEO (AIOSEO).</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>While genuine versions of AIOSEO have a license checking feature, in AIOSEO Pro nulled plugins this feature is disabled. AIOSEO Pro nulled plugins may be advertised as having a &#8220;free license key&#8221; or &#8220;activated key.&#8221;</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-aioseo-theme-notice-box\" role=\"alert\">\n<p><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/all-in-one-seo-pack/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\"><strong>Get the Genuine AIOSEO Plugin for Free</strong></a><strong> </strong></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-why-is-aioseo-pro-nulled-dangerous\">Why is AIOSEO Pro Nulled Dangerous?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The security firm WordFence <a href=\"https://www.wordfence.com/blog/2021/01/the-wordfence-2020-wordpress-threat-report/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">found</a> that nulled plugins &#8220;typically contain backdoor functionality&#8221; and because of that, they&#8217;re &#8220;the most widespread threat&#8221; to WordPress websites.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Nulled plugins, including AIOSEO Pro nulled, are often used to inject malware. Security firms have published numerous reports on cyberattacks caused by nulled plugins. These include</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Installing backdoors so hackers can control your site.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Installing skimmers to steal credit card information.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Injecting links, including to illegal websites.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Hijacking sites to mine cryptocurrency.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>According to a <a href=\"https://www.wordfence.com/blog/2021/01/the-wordfence-2020-wordpress-threat-report/#malware-from-nulled-plugins-most-widespread-threat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">recent report</a>, &#8220;malware distributed via nulled, pirated, or counterfeit plugins and themes&#8221; is &#8220;one of the largest threats facing the WordPress ecosystem.&#8221;</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-vulnerability-of-small-businesses\">Vulnerability of Small Businesses</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Approximately <a href=\"https://www.verizon.com/business/resources/reports/2019/2019-data-breach-investigations-report.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">43%</a> of U.S. cyberattacks target small businesses. And <a href=\"https://cdn.advocacy.sba.gov/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/05122043/Small-Business-FAQ-2020.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">80%</a> of small businesses have no IT staff.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Using AIOSEO Pro nulled, or any nulled plugin, exposes your business to:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Revenue loss</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Reputational loss</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Destruction of your SEO.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/aioseo-pro-nulled-1024x683.jpeg\" alt=\"aioseo pro nulled\" class=\"wp-image-166309\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/aioseo-pro-nulled-1024x683.jpeg 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/aioseo-pro-nulled-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/aioseo-pro-nulled-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/aioseo-pro-nulled-1536x1024.jpeg 1536w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/aioseo-pro-nulled-2048x1365.jpeg 2048w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/aioseo-pro-nulled-600x400.jpeg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/aioseo-pro-nulled-90x60.jpeg 90w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/aioseo-pro-nulled-135x90.jpeg 135w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-security-threats-posed-by-aioseo-pro-nulled-plugins\">Security Threats Posed by AIOSEO Pro nulled Plugins</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Here are a few of the known security risks posed by nulled plugins.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-injection-of-malware\">Injection of Malware</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Hackers <a href=\"https://www.wordfence.com/blog/2021/07/nulled-wordpress-plugins/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">often use nulled plugins</a> as vehicles for malware. Like the Trojan Horse of ancient Greece, the trick starts with convincing users they&#8217;re getting a great deal.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Beware: It can be difficult, costly, (or even impossible) to recover your site from a serious malware infection.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-installing-secret-backdoors\">Installing Secret Backdoors</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The malware&#8217;s often used to install secret backdoors. These allow bad actors to take over your website.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Backdoors can also be used to gain access to your email, computer, and/or web server.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>For example, we know of a case where a site owner installed a nulled plugin, only to see his site hijacked to mine cryptocurrency.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Hackers have also developed <a href=\"https://blog.sucuri.net/2021/12/php-re-infectors-the-malware-that-keeps-on-giving.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">zombified backdoors</a> that spring back to life after supposedly being removed.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-selling-access-to-your-site\">Selling Access to Your Site</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Sometime the hacker will add his own password protection to the backdoor so he can sell access to your website on the <a href=\"https://www.zdnet.com/article/a-cybercrime-store-is-selling-access-to-more-than-43000-hacked-servers/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">black market</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>These online cybercrime shops are thriving. There are even cybercrime stores selling hacked access to <a href=\"https://krebsonsecurity.com/2022/01/crime-shop-sells-hacked-logins-to-other-crime-shops/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\"><em>other</em></a> cybercrime stores.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-using-your-email-for-spam-or-phishing-attacks\">Using Your Email for Spam or Phishing Attacks</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Malware that compromises your mail server can give hackers access to your domain-based email.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>That means they can send out email messages in your name and spread malware hacks to your customers and prospects.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"645\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/phishing-illustration-1024x645.jpeg\" alt=\"phishing illustration\" class=\"wp-image-166312\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/phishing-illustration-1024x645.jpeg 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/phishing-illustration-300x189.jpeg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/phishing-illustration-768x484.jpeg 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/phishing-illustration-1536x968.jpeg 1536w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/phishing-illustration-2048x1290.jpeg 2048w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/phishing-illustration-600x378.jpeg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/phishing-illustration-95x60.jpeg 95w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/phishing-illustration-143x90.jpeg 143w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-data-theft\">Data Theft</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Malware infections from nulled plugins can be used to steal customer records, intellectual property, and financial records.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>This can lead to reputational and revenue loss for the targeted business. And it can leave your business exposed to liability risks.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-installing-card-skimmers\">Installing Card Skimmers</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Nulled plugins are known vectors for online skimmers.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Just like the skimmers at gas pumps, online skimmers steal credit card information in order to raid bank accounts</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-black-hat-seo-and-bad-links\">Black Hat SEO and Bad Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>In this scenario the hacker injects links into your site. These links are designed to boost the SEO of various <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/essentials/spam-policies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">link schemes</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>For example, the links may point to</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Illegal drug sites or porn sites</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sites that will download malware onto your users&#8217; websites.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Google penalizes sites that participate in link schemes. This means your website can be de-indexed (removed entirely from search results) and lose its search engine rankings you fought hard to obtain.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>In addition, Google&#8217;s Chrome browser may display a security warning when searchers access your website.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"440\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/google-security-warning-1-1024x440.png\" alt=\"google security warning\" class=\"wp-image-166314\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/google-security-warning-1-1024x440.png 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/google-security-warning-1-300x129.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/google-security-warning-1-768x330.png 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/google-security-warning-1-600x258.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/google-security-warning-1-140x60.png 140w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/google-security-warning-1-210x90.png 210w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/google-security-warning-1.png 1307w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><em>Above: Example of a Google Chrome security warning. This particular one is for a page on a well-known cybersecurity company website. (We notified them of the issue.</em>)</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-adding-malicious-content-to-your-site\">Adding Malicious Content to Your Site</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Because they have access to your site, hackers can add malicious content to your site to spread infections further.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Indeed, hacks from nulled plugins are often designed to be hidden from WordPress administrators, so you may not even see that you&#8217;ve been hacked.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-lack-of-professional-support-and-documentation\">Lack of Professional Support </h2>\n\n\n\n<p>When you use a nulled version of All in One SEO (AIOSEO), you don&#8217;t get access to our professional support team.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Staffed with experienced engineers, our support team provides an array of services from assistance with SEO settings to answering and resolving advanced technical needs.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Likewise, we publish and maintain clear documentation for our users. Plugin fees enable us to provide all of these services.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-unethical-use-undermines-small-businesses\">Unethical Use Undermines Small Businesses</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>We all like a good shortcut, but using a nulled plugin undermines the work being done at All in One SEO (AIOSEO).</p>\n\n\n\n<p>We&#8217;re a small team whose work includes:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Research and development of new software features.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Experimentation with SEO tactics and marketing strategies.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Growing our professional team of experienced engineers and growth marketers to assist users.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Publishing documentation, training materials, and playbooks to help your site rank.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-a-special-thank-you\">A Special Thank You</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Our small team is passionate about making it easy for beginners and pros alike to improve their SEO rankings and traffic with our powerful WordPress SEO plugin.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"774\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/aioseo-team-1024x774.png\" alt=\"aioseo team\" class=\"wp-image-166316\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/aioseo-team-1024x774.png 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/aioseo-team-300x227.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/aioseo-team-768x580.png 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/aioseo-team-600x453.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/aioseo-team-79x60.png 79w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/aioseo-team-119x90.png 119w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/aioseo-team.png 1503w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>All in One SEO (AIOSEO) has garnered thousands of 5-star ratings All in One SEO (AIOSEO) on WordPress with many calling it the best WordPress SEO plugin. We’re grateful for the rave reviews that our world class support team gets.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Here&#8217;s some of our favorite customer feedback:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>&#8220;Amazing plugin and equally amazing staff.&#8221;</li>\n\n\n\n<li>&#8220;I like this plug-in because it is very user friendly and the developers offer great support.&#8221;</li>\n\n\n\n<li>&#8220;I manage two dozen WordPress sites and have used various SEO plug-ins. AIOSEO is the most intuitive, most comprehensive and also the best performing plugin I have worked with so far. Congratulations for the excellent development!&#8221;</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>We&#8217;re steadily growing our business, and even sharing our own <strong>success playbook</strong> with our customers.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>This is all made possible by our paying customers.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>At All in One SEO (AIOSEO), our relationship with you doesn&#8217;t end when you download