loads/2023/03/aioseo-link-assistant-1-158x90.png 158w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/aioseo-link-assistant-1.png 1220w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Local businesses can set up their <strong>local SEO</strong> basics by clicking a few buttons and filling a form out.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>All of our paid plugins offer many easy-to-use tools to boost your rankings:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>TruSEO Analysis</strong>: Get simple recommendations for on-page SEO optimization. This is your built-in checklist and SEO advisor for optimizing title tags, meta descriptions, target keywords, and readability.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Advanced SEO Modules</strong></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>XML Sitemaps, RSS Sitemaps, and HTML Sitemaps: </strong>These are automatically generated and updated. (Our sitemaps come with granular control such as the ability to disable post types and taxonomies.)</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Smart Schema</strong>: Add schema markup so your pages can be displayed as fancy rich snippets in search results.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Custom Breadcrumbs</strong>: Add breadcrumb navigation for a few clicks. This action can support SEO while boosting site visitor engagement.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Ecommerce features </strong>including Product schema and WooCommerce SEO (optimization of products, product categories, and more).</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Social Media Integration</strong>: Optimize how your posts appear in social media.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Google AMP SEO</strong></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Integration with webmaster tools </strong>like Google Search Console, Microsoft Clarity, IndexNow, Google Analytics, Bing, Baidu, and Yandex.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Integration with <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/recommends/elementor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">Elementor</a>, <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/recommends/divi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">Divi</a>, <a href=\"https://www.seedprod.com/\" target=\"_b