pener\" title=\"\">RafflePress</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://sugarcalendar.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"\">Sugar Calendar</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://wpsimplepay.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"\">WP Simple Pay</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pushengage.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"\">Push Engage</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-100-no-risk-money-back-guarantee\">100% No-Risk, Money-Back Guarantee</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>If for any reason you&#8217;re not satisfied with All in One SEO (AIOSEO), let us know within 14 days and we&#8217;ll happily refund your money.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>We offer this money-back guarantee because we&#8217;re confident you&#8217;ll love the plugin.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>When weighing the benefits of a genuine AIOSEO plugin against the risks of AIOSEO Pro nulled, isn&#8217;t the choice obvious?</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-how-to-get-a-aioseo-pro-license-key-free-aioseo-pro-latest-version\">How to Get a AIOSEO Pro License Key Free (AIOSEO Pro &#8211; Latest Version)</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>We understand the motivation behind getting an All in One SEO (AIOSEO) Pro License Key for free or at a discounted rate.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>While we&#8217;ve shared the dangers of using unethically-sourced AIOSEO Pro nulled and cracked plugins and licenses, we&#8217;ve also shared how you can get the genuine plugin for free.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can also get <strong>genuine</strong> premium AIOSEO plugins at <strong>steep discounts</strong>. Here&#8217;s how.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-update-from-free-aioseo-lite-to-aioseo-pro-for-60-off\">Update from Free AIOSEO Lite to AIOSEO Pro for 60% Off</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>AIOSEO Lite Users can upgrade to the premium Pro version and get <strong>60% off </strong>by using <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/lite-upgrade/\">this coupon code</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-aioseo-sales\">AIOSEO Sales</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>We also routinely run sales. For example, we recently ran a Winter Sale with up to <strong>70% off</strong> our premium plugins.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Keep an eye on our website to get these deals.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"642\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/winter-1024x642.jpg\" alt=\"aioseo pro sale\" class=\"wp-image-166320\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/winter-1024x642.jpg 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/winter-300x188.jpg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/winter-768x482.jpg 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/winter-1536x963.jpg 1536w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/winter-2048x1284.jpg 2048w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/winter-600x376.jpg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/winter-96x60.jpg 96w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/winter-144x90.jpg 144w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-affiliate-websites-vs-aioseo-pro-nulled-sites\">Affiliate Websites vs. AIOSEO Pro Nulled Sites</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>All in One SEO (AIOSEO) has an <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/affiliates/\">affiliate program</a> that offers a 20% commission for sales of our plugin.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>So there are many legitimate websites promoting All in One SEO (AIOSEO). How can you tell the difference between an affiliate website that recommends AIOSEO and a site hawking AIOSEO Pro nulled?</p>\n\n\n\n<p>It&#8217;s simple:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Affiliate sites will provide &#8220;buy&#8221; links that send you here, to the <strong>aioseo.com website.</strong></li>\n\n\n\n<li>AIOSEO Pro nulled plugin sites do not send you to aioseo.com. Instead, their download links will send you to other websites.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-aioseo-pro-nulled-marketed-under-different-names\">AIOSEO Pro Nulled Marketed Under Different Names</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Websites hawking All in One SEO Pro nulled use various names for the plugin. These may include the terms nulled, null, cracked, GPL, free license key, or activated key.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Here are some examples:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>All in One SEO Pack Nulled</li>\n\n\n\n<li>All in One SEO Pack Pro 4.3.0 Nulled + AddOns</li>\n\n\n\n<li>All in One SEO Pack Nulled 4.3.0</li>\n\n\n\n<li>All in One SEO Pack Pro Nulled</li>\n\n\n\n<li>All in One SEO Pro Pack NULLED 4.2.8</li>\n\n\n\n<li>All in One SEO Pro Package Pack 4.2.7.1</li>\n\n\n\n<li>All in One SEO Pack Pro V4.2.8 Activated Key for WordPress</li>\n\n\n\n<li>GPL All in One SEO Pack Pro 4.3.0 + 6 Addons [License Key]</li>\n\n\n\n<li>All in One SEO Pack Pro v4.0.11 [Activated] Free Download</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-url-features-of-sites-hawking-aioseo-pro-nulled\">URL Features of Sites Hawking AIOSEO Pro Nulled</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>These sites also often (<em>but not always</em>) include these terms in their domain names:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>gpl</li>\n\n\n\n<li>nulled</li>\n\n\n\n<li>null</li>\n\n\n\n<li>cracked</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-summing-it-up\">Summary: Best Way to Protect Against AIOSEO Pro Nulled</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Countless cybersecurity experts have stated that nulled WordPress plugins pose a serious threat to users.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>As the proverb says, &#8220;An ounce of prevention is worth a pound of cure.&#8221;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The best way to protect yourself from nulled plugins is to avoid them in the first place.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-bonus-tips\">Bonus Tips</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Free SEO Analysis</strong>: Get a free site audit by using our <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/seo-analyzer/\">SEO Analyzer</a>.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Avoid nulled or cracked WordPress <strong><em>themes</em></strong> as well. These are unsafe for the same reasons nulled plugins are.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Keep your WordPress version <strong>updated</strong>: WordPress periodically releases a new version of its software, and these releases often include security upgrades.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Keep your genuine, premium plugins <strong>updated</strong>.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Visit our site for <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/faqs/\" title=\"\">FAQs</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-whats-next\">What&#8217;s Next?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>We hope this post helped you understand why AIOSEO Pro nulled is dangerous and how you can get a genuine plugin at low cost.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can also check out our article on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/small-business-seo-scams-how-to-detect-and-avoid-them/\">Small Business SEO Scams</a> and <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/what-are-serps/\">What are SERPs (and Why are They Important For SEO)?</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you found this article helpful, then please subscribe to our <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/AIOSEO\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">YouTube</a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/AIOSEO\"> Channel</a>. You’ll find plenty of search engine optimization tutorials there. You can also follow us on <a href=\"https://twitter.com/aioseopack\">Twitter</a>, <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/aioseo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">LinkedIn</a>, or <a href=\"https://facebook.com/aioseopack/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">Facebook</a> to stay in the loop.</p>The post <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/aioseo-pro-nulled-security-warning/\">[SECURITY WARNING] Why You MUST Avoid “Free” AIOSEO Pro Nulled</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com\">AIOSEO</a>.\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:36:\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\";a:1:{s:10:\"commentRss\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:59:\"https://aioseo.com/aioseo-pro-nulled-security-warning/feed/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:38:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\";a:1:{s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:1:\"0\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:4;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:88:\"\n		\n		\n					\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n\n					\n										\n					\n					\n			\n		\n		\n			\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:5:{s:0:\"\";a:7:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:77:\"[NEW] Dominate Search Rankings with AIOSEO’s AI Title/Description Generator\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:200:\"https://aioseo.com/dominate-search-rankings-with-aioseos-ai-title-description-generator/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=dominate-search-rankings-with-aioseos-ai-title-description-generator\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:97:\"https://aioseo.com/dominate-search-rankings-with-aioseos-ai-title-description-generator/#comments\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Tue, 07 Mar 2023 14:06:04 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:6:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:13:\"Announcements\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:4:\"Blog\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:29:\"Ai meta description generator\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:23:\"AI post title generator\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:12:\"AI SEO tools\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:30:\"AI Title/Description Generator\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:28:\"https://aioseo.com/?p=164747\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:532:\"<p>We’ve just rolled out a brand new feature we know you’ll love in AIOSEO 4.3.2. Introducing our new AI Title/Description Generator.&#160; This is a game-changing AI-powered post title and meta description generator. Metadata like your post title and meta description&#8230;</p>\nThe post <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/dominate-search-rankings-with-aioseos-ai-title-description-generator/\">[NEW] Dominate Search Rankings with AIOSEO’s AI Title/Description Generator</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com\">AIOSEO</a>.\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:14:\"Benjamin Rojas\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:6703:\"<p>We’ve just rolled out a brand new feature we know you’ll love in AIOSEO 4.3.2. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Introducing our new <strong>AI Title/Description Generator</strong>.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>This is a game-changing AI-powered post title and meta description generator.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Metadata like your post title and meta description play a huge role in helping you get people to click on your search listing on search engine results pages. As a result, you’ll drive more traffic to your site and boost your search rankings.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>We partnered with <strong>OpenAI</strong>, one of the leading AI brands, to create our all-new AI Title/Description Generator. This game-changing tool will revolutionize how you craft post titles and meta descriptions, giving you an edge over your competitors.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Let’s quickly dive into what this means for you.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-take-the-labor-out-of-crafting-post-titles-and-meta-descriptions\">Take the Labor Out of Crafting Post Titles and Meta Descriptions</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>One of the most significant benefits of this latest installment to our toolkit is that it helps take the labor out of crafting post titles and meta descriptions. This is because the AI Title/Description Generator does this for you at the click of a button.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"699\" height=\"353\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/seo-title-generator-1.png\" alt=\"Add Post Titles and Meta Descriptions with 1-click.\" class=\"wp-image-165754\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/seo-title-generator-1.png 699w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/seo-title-generator-1-300x152.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/seo-title-generator-1-600x303.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/seo-title-generator-1-119x60.png 119w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/seo-title-generator-1-178x90.png 178w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 699px) 100vw, 699px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Simply click the robot icon next to the <strong>Post Title</strong> or <strong>Meta Description</strong> fields. The tool will then generate 5 suggestions based on your content.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>In the example below, we’ll generate a Post Title for an article entitled <strong>How To Easily Add Box Shadows in WordPress (4 Easy Ways)</strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"378\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results.jpeg\" alt=\"The AI Title/Description Generator gives you 5 suggestions you can choose from.\" class=\"wp-image-165755\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results.jpeg 700w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-300x162.jpeg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-600x324.jpeg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-111x60.jpeg 111w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-167x90.jpeg 167w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Next, choose the one you like by clicking the <strong>(+)</strong> button next to your preferred post title.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"699\" height=\"168\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-2.jpeg\" alt=\"Simply click the plus sign next to your preferred Post Title to add it.\" class=\"wp-image-165756\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-2.jpeg 699w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-2-300x72.jpeg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-2-600x144.jpeg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-2-190x46.jpeg 190w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/post-title-generator-results-2-374x90.jpeg 374w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 699px) 100vw, 699px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Once done, you can edit your post title if need be.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2>The AI Title/Description Generator: Your New SEO Super Power</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Our new AI Title/Description Generator is a powerful tool that will help you generate engaging SEO post titles and meta descriptions. And all it takes is 1 click! </p>\n\n\n\n<p>This powerful tool will help you save time and ensure your metadata is optimized for search engines and users.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Plus, the benefits of the AI Title/Description Generator are further compounded if you have a lot of content to update on your site.&nbsp;That&#8217;s because manually updating post titles and meta descriptions on hundreds of pages can be time-consuming. Instead, with our new AI Title/Description Generator, you can accomplish this task effortlessly and efficiently. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>And you can rest assured they&#8217;ll be optimized for search engines and users.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you want to speed up post title and meta description creation, then this is the right tool. It will give your content a better chance of ranking higher on search engines and generating more clicks.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Besides this major update, we’ve made several notable improvements to many features you love. You can see those in our <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/changelog/\" title=\"AIOSEO Changelog\">product changelog</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>So, what are you waiting for?&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Update your site to AIOSEO 4.3.2 to unlock this powerful new feature and rank your content higher on SERPs.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you’re not yet using AIOSEO, then make sure to <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/pricing/\" title=\"Pricing\">install and activate the plugin today</a>. Our SEO plugin will help you outrank your competitors.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you have questions about these features, please comment below or <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/contact/\" title=\"Contact Us\">contact our customer support team</a>. We’re always ready to help.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Our commitment to making AIOSEO the easiest and best WordPress SEO plugin is only getting stronger as we continue to win together with our customers.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>We’re so grateful for your continued support, feedback, and suggestions. Please keep those suggestions and feature requests coming!</p>\n\n\n\n<p>We hope you enjoy using these new SEO features as much as we enjoyed creating them.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><em>-Benjamin Rojas (President of AIOSEO).</em></p>The post <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/dominate-search-rankings-with-aioseos-ai-title-description-generator/\">[NEW] Dominate Search Rankings with AIOSEO’s AI Title/Description Generator</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com\">AIOSEO</a>.\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:36:\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\";a:1:{s:10:\"commentRss\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:93:\"https://aioseo.com/dominate-search-rankings-with-aioseos-ai-title-description-generator/feed/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:38:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\";a:1:{s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:2:\"11\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:5;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:88:\"\n		\n		\n					\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n\n					\n										\n					\n					\n			\n		\n		\n			\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:5:{s:0:\"\";a:7:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:51:\"What is Structured Data and How Does it Impact SEO?\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:164:\"https://aioseo.com/what-is-structured-data-and-how-does-it-impact-seo/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=what-is-structured-data-and-how-does-it-impact-seo\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:78:\"https://aioseo.com/what-is-structured-data-and-how-does-it-impact-seo/#respond\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Wed, 01 Mar 2023 16:06:38 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:6:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:4:\"Blog\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:8:\"SEO Tips\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:14:\"Schema for SEO\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:13:\"schema markup\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:15:\"structured data\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:23:\"What is structured data\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:28:\"https://aioseo.com/?p=162231\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:508:\"<p>Wondering what structured data is and how it impacts SEO?&#160; Maybe you&#8217;ve heard about &#8220;schema markup&#8221; and &#8220;rich snippets.&#8221; These things are all related. In this article, we&#8217;ll explain what structured data is and why it&#8217;s important for SEO. Plus&#8230;</p>\nThe post <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/what-is-structured-data-and-how-does-it-impact-seo/\">What is Structured Data and How Does it Impact SEO?</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com\">AIOSEO</a>.\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:15:\"Sherrie Gossett\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:30143:\"<p>Wondering what structured data is and how it impacts SEO?&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Maybe you&#8217;ve heard about &#8220;schema markup&#8221; and &#8220;rich snippets.&#8221; These things are all related.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>In this article, we&#8217;ll explain what structured data is and why it&#8217;s important for SEO. Plus you&#8217;ll learn how to add it to your pages today.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>It&#8217;s a lot easier than it sounds. Even a beginner can do it.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group aioseo-table-of-contents has-theme-info-background-color has-background\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<p>In This Article</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-aioseo-table-of-contents\"><ul><li><a href=\"#aioseo-what-is-structured-data-for-websites\">What is Structured Data for Websites?</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-structured-data-for-seo-benefits\">Structured Data for SEO: Benefits</a><ul></ul></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-what-is-schema-markup\">What is Schema Markup?</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-get-started-add-structured-data-with-just-a-few-clicks\">Get Started: Add Structured Data With Just a Few Clicks</a><ul><li><a href=\"#aioseo-what-schema-types-can-i-add\">What Schema Types Can I Add?</a><ul></ul></li></ul></li></ul></div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-what-is-structured-data-for-websites\">What is Structured Data for Websites?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Structured data is a method to add &#8220;tags&#8221; to your website content so Google understands it better.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>For example, recipe pages can have tags marking:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Ingredients</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Time of preparation</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Star rating average </li>\n\n\n\n<li>Total number of ratings</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"505\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/recipe-rich-snippet-example-1024x505.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-164117\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/recipe-rich-snippet-example-1024x505.jpg 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/recipe-rich-snippet-example-300x148.jpg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/recipe-rich-snippet-example-768x379.jpg 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/recipe-rich-snippet-example-600x296.jpg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/recipe-rich-snippet-example-122x60.jpg 122w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/recipe-rich-snippet-example-182x90.jpg 182w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/recipe-rich-snippet-example.jpg 1230w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>&#8220;How To&#8221; pages have tags marking:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Steps</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Supplies needed</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Time to complete project</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Unlike blog post tags, these tags (called &#8220;properties&#8221;) are invisible to readers. The tags are added to the HTML code of an individual webpage.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Here&#8217;s a list of structured data &#8216;tags&#8217; &#8211; from a review of the <em>Yellowstone</em> TV series.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"997\" height=\"551\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/structured-data-tags.png\" alt=\"structured data properties\" class=\"wp-image-162242\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/structured-data-tags.png 997w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/structured-data-tags-300x166.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/structured-data-tags-768x424.png 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/structured-data-tags-600x332.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/structured-data-tags-109x60.png 109w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/structured-data-tags-163x90.png 163w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>In the example you can see that each tag is a label for related information. For example, the &#8220;genre&#8221; is &#8220;Drama&#8221; and &#8220;Western.&#8221;</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-structured-data-for-seo-benefits\">Structured Data for SEO: Benefits</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Labeling your content with structured data tags has 2 main benefits.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>It helps Google understand your page content better.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>It makes your pages eligible to be displayed as rich snippets.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-higher-click-through-rates-ctrs\">Higher Click-Through Rates (CTRs)</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Rich snippets are a big deal. They can deliver significantly higher click-through rates.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can think of a rich snippet as a <strong>super-deluxe display</strong> in search results. Take a look.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Here&#8217;s a <em>standard </em>search snippet.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"253\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/standard-search-snippet-1024x253.png\" alt=\"standard search snippet\" class=\"wp-image-162246\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/standard-search-snippet-1024x253.png 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/standard-search-snippet-300x74.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/standard-search-snippet-768x190.png 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/standard-search-snippet-600x148.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/standard-search-snippet-190x47.png 190w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/standard-search-snippet-365x90.png 365w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/standard-search-snippet.png 1037w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>And here&#8217;s a <em>rich snippet</em>.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"528\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/mens-hoodies-product-rich-snippets-1024x528.jpg\" alt=\"ecommerce rich snippet example\" class=\"wp-image-162247\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/mens-hoodies-product-rich-snippets-1024x528.jpg 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/mens-hoodies-product-rich-snippets-300x155.jpg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/mens-hoodies-product-rich-snippets-768x396.jpg 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/mens-hoodies-product-rich-snippets-1536x792.jpg 1536w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/mens-hoodies-product-rich-snippets-2048x1056.jpg 2048w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/mens-hoodies-product-rich-snippets-600x309.jpg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/mens-hoodies-product-rich-snippets-116x60.jpg 116w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/mens-hoodies-product-rich-snippets-175x90.jpg 175w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Which would you rather have? It&#8217;s easy to see why rich snippets attract more click-throughs.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>On average, rich snippets get <strong>17%</strong> higher click-through rates (CTRs) compared to standard search snippets. And of all rich snippet types, <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-use-a-wordpress-faq-block-to-boost-seo-and-get-more-traffic/\">FAQs</a> get the highest CTR (<strong>87%</strong>) of all search results. (Source: <a href=\"https://blog.milestoneinternet.com/seo/seo-click-curves-get-58-clicks-per-100/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">Milestone Research</a>.)</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"481\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/faq-schema-example-1024x481.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-164129\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/faq-schema-example-1024x481.jpg 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/faq-schema-example-300x141.jpg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/faq-schema-example-768x361.jpg 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/faq-schema-example-600x282.jpg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/faq-schema-example-128x60.jpg 128w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/faq-schema-example-192x90.jpg 192w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/faq-schema-example.jpg 1377w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><em>Thanks to structured data,</em> <em>two expandable FAQs appear at the bottom of this TripAdvisor search snippet. Clicking on the FAQs reveals additional links.</em></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>There are <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/what-is-structured-data-and-how-does-it-impact-seo/#aioseo-what-schema-types-can-i-add\" title=\"\">many other types</a> of rich snippet displays, including for courses, books, and events.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-appear-in-more-search-queries\">Appear in More Search Queries</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Adding structured data has another benefit too. Your content can show up in <strong>more search queries</strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>For example, your recipe pages can show up in searches people make for combinations of ingredients and/or cooking time.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>This is because these details are tagged with structured data.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-what-is-schema-markup\">What is Schema Markup?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>If you&#8217;ve been reading about structured data, you&#8217;ve probably heard of &#8220;schema markup.&#8221;</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Structured data</strong> refers to the way your content is tagged. It includes rules and it has its own vocabulary.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Schema markup</strong> is the code for the tags. It <em>communicates</em> the structured data to Google.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>So how do you get this markup added to a web page?</p>\n\n\n\n<p>It&#8217;s actually quite easy.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-get-started-add-structured-data-with-just-a-few-clicks\">Get Started: Add Structured Data With Just a Few Clicks</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>WordPress users can add structured data easily, with no technical knowledge.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>To do this, we recommend that you download and install the<a href=\"https://aioseo.com/pricing/\"> All in One SEO (AIOSEO) plugin</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The plugin has thousands of 5-star ratings on WordPress.org. It&#8217;s currently used by over 3 million sites.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"485\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-1024x485.png\" alt=\"aioseo homepage\" class=\"wp-image-140989\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-1024x485.png 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-300x142.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-768x364.png 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-600x284.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-127x60.png 127w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-190x90.png 190w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage.png 1260w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>You can get started with this article <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-add-rich-snippets-to-wordpress/\">How to Add Rich Snippets to WordPress</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>All it takes to add schema is a few <strong>button clicks</strong>.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>And for some items, you&#8217;ll fill out a <strong>form</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>By default, AIOSEO adds the &#8220;Article&#8221; schema type to your pages. But there are plenty of other types to pick from.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-what-schema-types-can-i-add\">What Schema Types Can I Add?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>All in One SEO (AIOSEO) offers the most popular schema types, listed below.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can add more than one schema type to a page. For example, if you have a blog post about an <strong>event</strong> and you have some <strong>FAQs</strong> on that page you could add:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>FAQ schema</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Event schema</li>\n\n\n\n<li>(&#8220;Article&#8221; schema is added by default.)</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Browse the list to find the &#8220;type&#8221; that matches what your web page is about.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Then click the link to get instructions for adding that schema type.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 id=\"aioseo-all-in-one-seo-aioseo-schema-types-with-instructions\">All in One SEO (AIOSEO) Schema Types With Instructions</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>All of these are easy to add. And all of the instructions are similar, with minor differences.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/setting-article-schema-markup-in-your-content/\">Article</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/setting-book-schema-markup-in-your-content/\">Book</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/setting-course-schema-markup-in-your-content/\">Course</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/setting-dataset-schema-markup-in-your-content/\">Dataset</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/setting-event-schema-markup-in-your-content/\">Event</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/setting-faq-page-schema-markup-in-your-content/\">FAQ</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/setting-fact-check-schema-markup-in-your-content/\">Fact Check</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/setting-how-to-schema-markup-in-your-content/\">How To</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/setting-job-posting-schema-markup-in-your-content/\">Job Posting</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/setting-movie-schema-markup-in-your-content/\">Movie</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/setting-music-schema-markup-in-your-content/\">Music</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/setting-person-schema-markup-in-your-content/\">Person</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-add-product-rich-snippets-in-wordpress/\">Product</a> (Google Merchant Listing schema)</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/setting-recipe-schema-markup-in-your-content/\">Recipe</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/setting-service-schema-markup-in-your-content/\">Service</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/setting-software-application-schema-markup-in-your-content/\">Software</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/setting-video-schema-markup-in-your-content/\">Video</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/setting-web-page-schema-markup-in-your-content/\">Web Page</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>When you log in to your WordPress editor, from the AIOSEO dashboard, you can find additional schema items:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Knowledge Graph:Add your information by filling out a form. (<strong>AIOSEO » Search Appearance » Global Settings</strong>)</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/adding-breadcrumbs-to-your-site-using-the-aioseo-breadcrumbs-block/\">Breadcrumbs</a>:Add breadcrumb navigation with 1 click (<strong>AIOSEO » General Settings » Breadcrumbs</strong>)</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Local business schema markup:Fill out a short form to activate.(<strong>AIOSEO » Local SEO</strong>)</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/how-to-get-google-to-display-the-sitelinks-search-box/\">Sitelinks search box</a>: Enable it with 1 click. (<strong>AIOSEO Settings » Search Appearance » Advanced</strong>)</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-aioseo-theme-notice-box\" role=\"alert\">\n<p>Google doesn&#8217;t guarantee that web pages with schema markup will be displayed as rich snippets. Its algorithms decide, on a case-by-case basis, how to display pages to users. The searcher&#8217;s internet connection speed may be one of several factors considered.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-calling-all-coders-try-out-google-codelab\">Calling all Coders: Try Out Google Codelab</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>If you enjoy learning about code, and want to learn how to add structured data manually, check out the <a href=\"https://codelabs.developers.google.com/codelabs/structured-data/index.html#0\">Google Codelab tutorial</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Or read our article: <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/add-schema-markup-to-wordpress-without-a-plugin/\">How to Add Schema Markup to WordPress Without a Plugin</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-measure-impact\">Measure Impact</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>As Google suggests, you can measure the impact of adding structured data to your pages by comparing marked up pages with plain pages.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>When making comparisons, choose pages that are similar.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>You can measure performance in Google Search Console or Google Analytics.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>An alternative is to use a plugin like ExactMetrics or <a href=\"https://www.monsterinsights.com/how-to-properly-setup-google-analytics-in-wordpress/\">MonsterInsights</a>. Both of these will display traffic information directly in your WordPress dashboard. And both pull that information from Google Analytics.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-aioseo-theme-notice-box\" role=\"alert\">\n<p>Users of the Elite version of AIOSEO can view Google Search Console data right in the plugin. <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/google-search-console-integration/\" title=\"\">Find out more</a>.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p>If you&#8217;re curious about how structured data works, read on. Otherwise feel free to <a href=\"#aioseo-whats-next\" title=\"\">skip to the conclusion</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-optional-some-nerdy-details-on-structured-data\">Optional: Some Nerdy Details on Structured Data</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>For Google to provide special visual elements to your search results, like star ratings and prices, it needs information about your page presented in a <strong>standardized format</strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Structured data tags (like &#8220;description&#8221; or &#8220;person&#8221;) come from a list of options developed and maintained on the Schema.org website. These tags are called &#8220;<strong>Properties.</strong>&#8220;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Examples of properties are:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Location</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Organizer</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sponsor.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Types</strong> are organized sets of properties.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>For example,<strong> Event</strong> is a schema &#8220;<strong>Type</strong>&#8221; that can include the following properties.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>doorTime</li>\n\n\n\n<li>duration</li>\n\n\n\n<li>startDate</li>\n\n\n\n<li>endDate</li>\n\n\n\n<li>location</li>\n\n\n\n<li>organizer.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>The specific properties used for a particular event page will depend on the type of event. For example, a music concert might include these properties.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>composer</li>\n\n\n\n<li>performer</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>The structure of information is called a schema, which means &#8220;plan.&#8221; This is where the term &#8220;schema markup&#8221; comes from.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>When you use a plugin like All in One SEO (AIOSEO) to apply schema, you&#8217;ll fill out a form providing information for only the properties that are relevant to your page.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-how-many-types-of-schema-are-there\">How Many Types of Schema Are There?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Schema.org houses almost <a href=\"https://schema.org/docs/schemas.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">800 types</a> of schema. Google supports 31 types for rich results. And this limited set of types is what&#8217;s used to improve website SEO.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-markup-languages-used-for-schema\">Markup Languages Used for Schema</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The code for schema markup is written in one of three markup languages.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>JSON-LD: JSON for Linking Data</li>\n\n\n\n<li>RDFa: Resource Description Framework in Attributes</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Microdata</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Of these 3, Google recommends JSON-LD. And that&#8217;s what the AIOSEO plugin uses.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-what-is-a-rich-results-test\">What is a Rich Results Test?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Google&#8217;s Rich Result Test is a free tool you can use to test a page for the presence and accuracy of structured data. You can also preview what your rich snippet would look like in search results.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The All in One SEO (AIOSEO) plugin enables you to run the Google Rich Results Tests directly from your WordPress editor. (Learn<a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-run-a-rich-results-test-in-wordpress/\"> How to Run a Rich Results Test in WordPress</a>.)</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-not-just-for-websites-other-uses-of-structured-data\">Not Just for Websites: Other Uses of Structured Data</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Big data, the processing of massive amounts of data to acquire insight, is a bedrock of business intelligence and research. And structured, unstructured, and semi-structured data all play a role.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Artificial intelligence (AI) and machine learning algorithms can be used to glean patterns from this data to improve business operations and reduce costs.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>For example, a French bakery used predictive analytics to discover that people buy more pastries on rainy days. They used that insight, along with weather reports, to plan the amount of pastries they prepared each day.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>These analytics are also used to predict customer churn, energy consumption, and revenue, among other forecasts.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"442\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/vaasan-ltd-homepage-1024x442.jpg\" alt=\"vaasan home page\" class=\"wp-image-162249\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/vaasan-ltd-homepage-1024x442.jpg 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/vaasan-ltd-homepage-300x129.jpg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/vaasan-ltd-homepage-768x331.jpg 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/vaasan-ltd-homepage-600x259.jpg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/vaasan-ltd-homepage-139x60.jpg 139w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/vaasan-ltd-homepage-209x90.jpg 209w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/vaasan-ltd-homepage.jpg 1377w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><em>Following the pandemic, Finnish bakery Vaasan Ltd. started using AI to improve planning by predicting energy consumption and cost trends. (Source:</em><a href=\"https://www.ibm.com/blogs/journey-to-ai/2021/06/how-bakery-company-vaasan-used-ai-to-upgrade-their-planning/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\"> <em>IBM</em></a><em>)</em></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The explosion of data has led to creation of new businesses, spanning:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Data-driven business strategy consulting</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Data modeling and data mining</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Data analysis</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Data warehouses (also called data lakes)</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Development of relational databases and non-relational databases. (Sometimes referred to as SQL databases and NoSQL databases. (SQL stands for &#8220;Structured Query Language&#8221; and NoSQL for &#8220;Not Only SQL.&#8221;)</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-structured-data-unstructured-data-and-semi-structured-data\">Structured Data, Unstructured Data, and Semi-Structured Data</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>As you read about structured data you&#8217;ll likely see comparisons of it to &#8220;unstructured&#8221; and &#8220;semi-structured&#8221; data. This refers to how well-organized the data is.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>To understand the difference, replace the word &#8220;data&#8221; with &#8220;things.&#8221; We all have things in our lives that are <strong>organized</strong> (structured), <strong>semi-organized</strong> (semi-structured), or <strong>unorganized</strong> (unstructured).</p>\n\n\n\n<p>These &#8220;things&#8221; could be our closets, vacation plans, or hobby collections.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Imagine your hobby is collecting rocks and minerals.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>If your rocks are in a pile in your garage, we&#8217;d say they were unorganized (unstructured).</li>\n\n\n\n<li>If your rocks were partially labeled, but not fully organized, we could say they were semi-organized (&#8220;semi-structured&#8221;).</li>\n\n\n\n<li>And if your rocks were all carefully labeled and sorted according to type, and displayed neatly in rows on shelves, we could say your collection is organized (&#8220;structured&#8221;).</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Organizing things (and structuring data) makes it easier to understand, analyze, and use them.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"892\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/smithsonian-azurite-sample-1024x892.png\" alt=\"smithsonian azurite sample\" class=\"wp-image-164304\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/smithsonian-azurite-sample-1024x892.png 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/smithsonian-azurite-sample-300x261.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/smithsonian-azurite-sample-768x669.png 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/smithsonian-azurite-sample-1536x1338.png 1536w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/smithsonian-azurite-sample-2048x1784.png 2048w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/smithsonian-azurite-sample-600x523.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/smithsonian-azurite-sample-69x60.png 69w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/smithsonian-azurite-sample-103x90.png 103w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><em>The Smithsonian museum&#8217;s collection of rocks and minerals is highly organized in online and in-person displays. Each specimen is carefully labeled with details about where it was taken from, its size, which specific Smithsonian collection it can be found in, and more.</em></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-examples-of-structured-data\">Examples of Structured Data</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>A spreadsheet with rows and columns is a familiar tool to structure data. For example, a business might have a spreadsheet of prospects, with names listed in rows, and columns for company and contact information.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"367\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-sheets-template-1024x367.png\" alt=\"structured data spreadsheet\" class=\"wp-image-162252\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-sheets-template-1024x367.png 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-sheets-template-300x107.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-sheets-template-768x275.png 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-sheets-template-600x215.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-sheets-template-168x60.png 168w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-sheets-template-251x90.png 251w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-sheets-template.png 1285w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Website <strong>sitemaps</strong> are another example. Written in XML (Extensible Markup Language), they use tags to turn website content into a structured map that search engines read.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"646\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/aioseo-xml-sitemap-1024x646.png\" alt=\"xml sitemap as structured data\" class=\"wp-image-162256\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/aioseo-xml-sitemap-1024x646.png 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/aioseo-xml-sitemap-300x189.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/aioseo-xml-sitemap-768x485.png 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/aioseo-xml-sitemap-600x379.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/aioseo-xml-sitemap-95x60.png 95w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/aioseo-xml-sitemap-143x90.png 143w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/aioseo-xml-sitemap.png 1336w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><em>This is an example of a sitemap. Sitemaps are important for SEO; the AIOSEO plugin generates and updates </em><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/how-to-create-an-xml-sitemap/\"><em>sitemaps</em></a><em> automatically for you.</em></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-examples-of-semi-structured-data\">Examples of Semi-Structured Data</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Emails, social media posts, and web pages are everyday examples of semi-structured data. They have some structure, but the content varies widely, and may include images, text, audio, numbers, tables, and so on.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-examples-of-unstructured-data\">Examples of Unstructured Data</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>A recording of a conversation or lecture is a simple example of unstructured data.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>In its raw form, the recording doesn&#8217;t include labeled sections, a description of the content, dates, or other pertinent information.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-resources\">Resources</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Learn how to <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-use-a-wordpress-faq-block-to-boost-seo-and-get-more-traffic/\">add FAQ schema</a> easily, with a button click.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Learn how to <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-run-a-rich-results-test-in-wordpress/\">run a rich results test</a> to verify your schema&#8217;s been applied correctly.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Technically-minded people may want to browse <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/appearance/structured-data/sd-policies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">Google&#8217;s guidelines for structured data.</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-whats-next\">What’s Next?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>We hope this post helped you understand what structured data is, how it can boost your SEO, and how to add it to your website.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Next, explore our article on how to <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/small-business-seo-scams-how-to-detect-and-avoid-them/\" title=\"\">avoid SEO scams</a> and discover a simple explanation of <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/what-is-google-knowledge-graph/\" title=\"\">Google Knowledge Graph</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you found this article helpful, then please subscribe to our <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/AIOSEO\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">YouTube Channel</a>. You’ll find many more helpful tutorials there. You can also follow us on <a href=\"https://twitter.com/aioseopack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">Twitter</a>, <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/aioseo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"\">LinkedIn</a>, or <a href=\"https://facebook.com/aioseopack/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">Facebook</a> to stay in the loop.</p>The post <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/what-is-structured-data-and-how-does-it-impact-seo/\">What is Structured Data and How Does it Impact SEO?</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com\">AIOSEO</a>.\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:36:\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\";a:1:{s:10:\"commentRss\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:75:\"https://aioseo.com/what-is-structured-data-and-how-does-it-impact-seo/feed/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:38:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\";a:1:{s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:1:\"0\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:6;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:82:\"\n		\n		\n					\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n		\n		\n\n					\n										\n					\n					\n			\n		\n		\n			\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:5:{s:0:\"\";a:7:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:54:\"12 Blogging Tools to Help You Grow Your WordPress Blog\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:102:\"https://aioseo.com/best-blogging-tools/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=best-blogging-tools\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:47:\"https://aioseo.com/best-blogging-tools/#respond\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Mon, 27 Feb 2023 13:37:24 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:4:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:4:\"Blog\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:21:\"best blogging plugins\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:19:\"best blogging tools\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:17:\"blogging software\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:28:\"https://aioseo.com/?p=160637\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:426:\"<p>Looking for the best blogging tools to help boost your online business? Choosing the right blogging tools can help you rank your blog high on search engine results pages (SERPs), leading to more traffic. Some can also help you discover&#8230;</p>\nThe post <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/best-blogging-tools/\">12 Blogging Tools to Help You Grow Your WordPress Blog</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com\">AIOSEO</a>.\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:11:\"Kato Nkhoma\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:35253:\"<p>Looking for the best blogging tools to help boost your online business?</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Choosing the right blogging tools can help you rank your blog high on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/what-are-serps/\" title=\"What Are SERPs (And Why Are they Important to SEO)?\">search engine results pages</a> (SERPs), leading to more traffic. Some can also help you discover growth opportunities, resulting in you reaching a wider audience and an increase in your earning potential.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>In this article, we will show you some of the best blogging tools you can use to grow your WordPress blog and increase your revenue.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group aioseo-table-of-contents has-theme-info-background-color has-background\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<p>In This Article</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-aioseo-table-of-contents\"><ul><li><a href=\"#aioseo-11-blogging-tools-to-grow-your-wordpress-blog-our-expert-picks\">12 Blogging Tools to Grow Your WordPress Blog: Our Expert Picks</a><ul><li><a href=\"#aioseo-1-all-in-one-seo-aioseo\">1. All In One SEO (AIOSEO)</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-2-seedprod\">2. SeedProd</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-3-optinmonster\">3. OptinMonster</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-4-wpforms\">4. WPForms</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-5-sendlayer\">5. SendLayer</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-6-monsterinsights\">6. MonsterInsights</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-7-pushengage\">7. PushEngage</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-8-rafflepress\">8. RafflePress</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-9-smash-balloon\">9. Smash Balloon</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-10-ahrefs\">10. Ahrefs</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-10-semrush\">11. Semrush</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-11-better-click-to-tweet\">12. Better Click to Tweet</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-the-best-blogging-tools-to-help-you-grow-your-wordpress-blog-our-top-picks\">The Best Blogging Tools to Help You Grow Your WordPress Blog: Our Top Picks</a></li></ul></div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-11-blogging-tools-to-grow-your-wordpress-blog-our-expert-picks\">12 Blogging Tools to Grow Your WordPress Blog: Our Expert Picks</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>With so many blogging tools on the market, choosing the right ones for your business can be daunting. So, we’ve taken out the hard work and curated this expertly picked list of the top WordPress blogging tools to help you grow your blog.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-1-all-in-one-seo-aioseo\">1. <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/pricing/\" title=\"Pricing\">All In One SEO</a> (AIOSEO)</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/pricing/\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"311\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo.png\" alt=\"aioseo homepage\" class=\"wp-image-151544\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo.png 700w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-300x133.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-600x267.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/pricing/\" title=\"Pricing\">AIOSEO</a> is a powerful yet easy-to-use SEO plugin that has been downloaded over 100 million times. Millions of smart bloggers use AIOSEO to help them boost their search engine rankings and drive qualified traffic to their blogs. That’s because the plugin has many powerful features and modules designed to help you properly configure your SEO settings. Examples include:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Search Statistics:</strong> This powerful <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/google-search-console-integration/\" title=\"Announcing AIOSEO 4.3.0 – Get Powerful Insights With Our Google Search Console Integration\">Google Search Console integration</a> lets you track your keyword rankings and see important SEO metrics with 1-click, and more.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Redirection Manager</strong>: Helps you <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/features/redirection-manager/\" title=\"Redirection Manager\">manage redirects</a> and eliminate 404 errors, making it easier for search engines to crawl and index your site.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Link Assistant</strong>: Powerful internal linking tool that <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/ways-link-assistant-can-save-you-time-on-internal-and-external-link-building/\" title=\"6 Ways Link Assistant Can Save You Time On Internal Link Building\">automates building links</a> between pages on your site. It also gives you an audit of outbound links.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>SEO Preview</strong>: This gives you an <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/what-is-the-seo-preview-tool/\" title=\"What is the SEO Preview Tool (And How to Use it to Drive More Traffic)?\">overview of your search and social snippets</a> and general SEO so you can improve your optimization.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>IndexNow:</strong> For fast indexing on search engines that support the <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/what-is-indexnow-for-seo/\" title=\"What is IndexNow for SEO (Explained in Plain English)?\">IndexNow protocol</a> (like Bing and Yandex).</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Sitemap generator</strong>: Automatically generate <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-create-a-sitemap-in-wordpress/\" title=\"How to Create a Sitemap in WordPress (The Easy Way)\">different types of sitemaps</a> to notify all search engines of any updates on your site.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/features/\">And more</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>AIOSEO also has other powerful tools for bloggers to help your blog posts rank and drive traffic. One such tool is TrueSEO. This is a powerful content optimization tool that helps you create SEO-friendly content. It helps you ​​easily add title tags, meta descriptions, keywords, and everything else you need for proper on-page SEO optimization.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>In addition, the Page Analysis feature is pretty handy as it gives insight into how well you’ve optimized your post. It also gives you recommendations for improving your content.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"702\" height=\"288\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-aioseo-page-analysis.png\" alt=\"The Page Analysis in AIOSE is a fantastic tool that helps you optimize your posts.\" class=\"wp-image-163386\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-aioseo-page-analysis.png 702w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-aioseo-page-analysis-300x123.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-aioseo-page-analysis-600x246.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-aioseo-page-analysis-146x60.png 146w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-aioseo-page-analysis-219x90.png 219w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 702px) 100vw, 702px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Another SEO feature many bloggers love in AIOSEO is <strong>Link Assistant</strong>. This is an AI-powered internal link building tool that helps you automatically build links between relevant pages on your blog.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"381\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/link-assistant-2.png\" alt=\"The Links Report dashboard gives you insight into linking opportunities and orphaned pages.\" class=\"wp-image-70919\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/link-assistant-2.png 700w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/link-assistant-2-300x163.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/link-assistant-2-600x327.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Internal link building is a fantastic on-page SEO that can help your articles rank and increase visitors&#8217; time on your site.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The SEO modules in AIOSEO are super easy to use, even if you don’t have any technical or coding knowledge. This makes AIOSEO the best blogging tool for beginner bloggers and experts alike.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Last but certainly not least comes the built-in <strong>Headline Analyzer</strong>. This powerful tool can help you optimize your blog post headlines for search and higher clickthrough rates (CTR).</p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can use the <strong>Headline Analyzer</strong> in the post editor.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"704\" height=\"528\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/blogging-tools-headline-analyzer.png\" alt=\"The Haedline Analyser is the best blogging tool for optimizing blog posts.\" class=\"wp-image-163388\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/blogging-tools-headline-analyzer.png 704w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/blogging-tools-headline-analyzer-300x225.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/blogging-tools-headline-analyzer-600x450.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/blogging-tools-headline-analyzer-80x60.png 80w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/blogging-tools-headline-analyzer-120x90.png 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 704px) 100vw, 704px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Or you can use the standalone Headline Analyzer under the SEO Analysis tab in AIOSEO…&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"702\" height=\"339\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/optimize-blog-titles-headline-analyzer-score.png\" alt=\"You get a score out of 100 for your headline.\" class=\"wp-image-163389\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/optimize-blog-titles-headline-analyzer-score.png 702w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/optimize-blog-titles-headline-analyzer-score-300x145.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/optimize-blog-titles-headline-analyzer-score-600x290.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/optimize-blog-titles-headline-analyzer-score-124x60.png 124w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/optimize-blog-titles-headline-analyzer-score-186x90.png 186w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 702px) 100vw, 702px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>If you’re a blogger, AIOSEO is the best <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/best-seo-plugins-for-wordpress/\" title=\"8 Best SEO Plugins for WordPress in 2023 (Tried and Tested)\">WordPress SEO plugin</a> to grow your audience and business.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>For step-by-step instructions on how to install AIOSEO, check our <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/installing-all-in-one-seo-pro/\" title=\"Installing All in One SEO Pro\">detailed installation guide</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>While the free version of AIOSEO can help you boost your rankings and drive traffic to your blog, the premium versions give you a greater competitive edge.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Pricing</strong>: Starts at $49.60.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-2-seedprod\">2. <a href=\"https://www.seedprod.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"SeedProd\">SeedProd</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://www.seedprod.com/\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"706\" height=\"400\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/best-free-wordpress-plugins-seedprod.png\" alt=\"SeedProd is one of the best blogging tools for building websites or landing pages.\" class=\"wp-image-99505\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/best-free-wordpress-plugins-seedprod.png 706w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/best-free-wordpress-plugins-seedprod-300x170.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/best-free-wordpress-plugins-seedprod-600x340.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 706px) 100vw, 706px\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.seedprod.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"SeedProd\">SeedProd</a> is undoubtedly the best website and page builder plugin for WordPress. Unsurprisingly, over 1 million professionals use it to build their websites. It’s a lightweight page builder designed with speed and SEO in mind.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Users love SeedProd because of its powerful drag-and-drop page builder that makes it easy to use. The plugin also has beautiful templates and pre-designed sections like headers and calls to action. All these make building your blog easy, even if you don’t have any technical or coding skills.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>SeedProd is also popular for its versatility. You can use it to create any type of website, including portfolio sites, business websites, non-profit websites, and more. And adding a blog to these is super easy. And with so many customization options, you can create a unique blog that stands out. For those times when you’re working on your site, SeedProd allows you to put your website into coming soon or <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-put-your-wordpress-site-in-maintenance-mode/\" title=\"How to Put Your WordPress Site in Maintenance Mode\">maintenance mode</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Besides building a blog, you can also use SeedProd to build landing pages to help you grow your audience. Examples include sales pages, opt-in pages, webinar pages, newsletter sign-ups, and more.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>And because of the powerful <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-optimize-seedprod-landing-pages-for-higher-rankings/\" title=\"How to Optimize Your Landing Pages with the SeedProd &amp; AIOSEO Integration\">AIOSEO/SeedProd integration</a>, SEO has never been easier. You can easily optimize your site and pages while creating them.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Pricing</strong>: Starts from $39.50.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-3-optinmonster\">3. <a href=\"https://optinmonster.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"OptinMonster\">OptinMonster</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://optinmonster.com/\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"397\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/best-wordpress-multisite-plugins-optinmonster.png\" alt=\"OptinMonster is perfect for driving up your conversion rates.\" class=\"wp-image-128843\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/best-wordpress-multisite-plugins-optinmonster.png 700w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/best-wordpress-multisite-plugins-optinmonster-300x170.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/best-wordpress-multisite-plugins-optinmonster-600x340.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://optinmonster.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"OptinMonster\">OptinMonster</a> is another fantastic blogging tool that can help you grow your WordPress blog. It’s an excellent tool for generating leads and growing your audience.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The plugin is built from the ground up to focus on increasing your subscriber base. You can use it to build beautiful pop-ups,slide-ins, floating bars, coupon wheels, and more on your blog. These are designed to help you create personalized messages and gamified lead generation strategies to help boost conversion rates.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Some OptinMonster features that help you grow your blog include page-level targeting, split testing, and analytics. It also comes with a proprietary technology called Exit-Intent® technology which allows you to display a lightbox popup when a user is about to leave your website.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Pricing</strong>: Starts at $9/month (billed annually).</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-4-wpforms\">4. <a href=\"https://wpforms.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"WPFprms\">WPForms</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://wpforms.com/\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"435\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/best-wordpress-multisite-plugins-wpforms.png\" alt=\"WPForms is the best blogging tool for form creation and management.\" class=\"wp-image-128844\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/best-wordpress-multisite-plugins-wpforms.png 700w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/best-wordpress-multisite-plugins-wpforms-300x186.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/best-wordpress-multisite-plugins-wpforms-600x373.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://wpforms.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"WPForms\">WPForms</a> is another excellent option if you’re looking for a WordPress plugin to help you grow your blog. It’s a powerful drag-and-drop contact form builder that makes it super easy to build any type of web form on your site.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can use WPForms to build custom contact forms, email subscription forms, order forms, payment forms, and other types of online forms. And you can do all this in a few clicks, even if you don’t have any design or coding skills. One reason is that the plugin has an exhaustive template library that includes template options for creating different landing pages, newsletter registration forms, and more.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Another advantage of WPForms is that it integrates with the most popular email marketing and customer relationship (CRM) tools. This makes growing your audience and blog easier, making WPForms one of the blogging tools to include in your toolbox.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Pricing</strong>: Starts at $199.50/year.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-5-sendlayer\">5. <a href=\"https://sendlayer.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"SendLayer\">SendLayer</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://sendlayer.com/\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"364\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-woocommerce-plugins-sendlayer.png\" alt=\"SendLayer is one of the best blogging tools for email marketing.\" class=\"wp-image-163392\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-woocommerce-plugins-sendlayer.png 700w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-woocommerce-plugins-sendlayer-300x156.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-woocommerce-plugins-sendlayer-600x312.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-woocommerce-plugins-sendlayer-115x60.png 115w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-woocommerce-plugins-sendlayer-173x90.png 173w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://sendlayer.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"SendLayer\">SendLayer</a> is an SMTP email service API that helps you send emails directly from WordPress to your subscribers without being marked as spam. This includes the various emails you may want to send, like newsletter subscription confirmation, newsletters, special offers, and more.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Most WordPress hosting providers don’t set up email deliverability from WordPress correctly. Some providers even block it. This results in emails from your blog to your subscribers not being sent.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>SendLayer helps you solve this problem without you touching a single line of code. It enables you to send any type of email right from within WordPress. Because SendLayer was built with email deliverability in mind, you can rest assured that your emails will reach your recipients.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>With email marketing integral to growing a thriving blog, a plugin like SendLayer is a must-have.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Pricing</strong>: $5/month (billed annually). A forever-free plan is also available.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-6-monsterinsights\">6. <a href=\"https://www.monsterinsights.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"MonsterInsights\">MonsterInsights</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://www.monsterinsights.com/\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"702\" height=\"410\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-wordpress-ecommerce-plugins-monsterinsights-2.png\" alt=\"MonsterInsights is the best Google Analytics plugin.\" class=\"wp-image-163398\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-wordpress-ecommerce-plugins-monsterinsights-2.png 702w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-wordpress-ecommerce-plugins-monsterinsights-2-300x175.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-wordpress-ecommerce-plugins-monsterinsights-2-600x350.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-wordpress-ecommerce-plugins-monsterinsights-2-103x60.png 103w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-wordpress-ecommerce-plugins-monsterinsights-2-154x90.png 154w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 702px) 100vw, 702px\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.monsterinsights.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"MonsterInsights\">MonsterInsights</a> is the best WordPress Google Analytics plugin on the market. Over 3 million users love it for its intuitive and easy-to-use interface. MonsterInsights gives you all the power of Google Analytics but with a more user-friendly interface. As a result, it’s one of the best ways to get deep insights into how visitors interact with your blog.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>With MonsterInsights, all it takes is a single click, and you’ll have real-time data on your blog&#8217;s performance. The plugin also gives you in-depth insight into the content your visitors love the most. This helps you create more of that type of content so they keep coming back for more.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can also create custom reports in MonsterInsights to help you see things like which categories or authors are most popular on your blog. You can also track affiliate link clicks and see real-time traffic stats. Plus, if you sell digital products on your blog using plugins like <a href=\"https://easydigitaldownloads.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Easy Digital Downloads\">Easy Digital Downloads</a>, MonsterInsights offers enhanced eCommerce tracking features.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>These features, and more, make MonsterInsights one of the best blogging tools to help you grow your WordPress blog.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Pricing</strong>: Starts at $99.50/year.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-7-pushengage\">7. <a href=\"https://www.pushengage.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"PushEngage\">PushEngage</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://www.pushengage.com/\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"702\" height=\"323\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-wordpress-lead-generation-plugins-push-engage.png\" alt=\"PushEngage helps send push notifications.\" class=\"wp-image-163401\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-wordpress-lead-generation-plugins-push-engage.png 702w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-wordpress-lead-generation-plugins-push-engage-300x138.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-wordpress-lead-generation-plugins-push-engage-600x276.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-wordpress-lead-generation-plugins-push-engage-130x60.png 130w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-wordpress-lead-generation-plugins-push-engage-196x90.png 196w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 702px) 100vw, 702px\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.pushengage.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"PushEngage\">PushEngage</a> is one of the best push notification software on the market. Web push notifications are an excellent tool to drive visitors back to your site. This gives you more opportunities to turn them into newsletter subscribers.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>PushEngage sends popup notifications of any activity on your site straight to users’ desktop and mobile browsers. It sends notifications when you publish a new blog post or have a special announcement on your blog. The plugin also makes it easy to send custom messages to those who’ve subscribed to receive push notifications. This way, you can still communicate with web visitors who aren’t on your email list and encourage them to become regular readers of your blog.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Pricing</strong>: Starts at $9/month.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-8-rafflepress\">8. <a href=\"https://rafflepress.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"RafflePress\">RafflePress</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://rafflepress.com/\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"702\" height=\"277\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-wordpress-lead-generation-plugins-rafflepress-1.png\" alt=\"RafflePress is the best contest and giveaway plugin.\" class=\"wp-image-163409\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-wordpress-lead-generation-plugins-rafflepress-1.png 702w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-wordpress-lead-generation-plugins-rafflepress-1-300x118.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-wordpress-lead-generation-plugins-rafflepress-1-600x237.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-wordpress-lead-generation-plugins-rafflepress-1-152x60.png 152w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-wordpress-lead-generation-plugins-rafflepress-1-228x90.png 228w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 702px) 100vw, 702px\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://rafflepress.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"RafflePress\">RafflePress</a> is another excellent tool you can use to grow your WordPress blog. It’s the best giveaway and raffle plugin for WordPress and makes it easy to grow your traffic, email list, and social media following by running a fun giveaway on your site. It’s also a fantastic way to boost your blog engagement.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>RafflePress enables you to incentivize actions on your blog, like visiting your social media profiles, sharing blog posts, watching videos, subscribing to your newsletter, and much more. Each time a user takes one of the actions you specify, they will get an entry into your prize draw.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Pricing</strong>: Starts at $39.50/year.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-9-smash-balloon\">9. <a href=\"https://smashballoon.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Smash Balloon\">Smash Balloon</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://smashballoon.com/\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-smashballoon.png\" alt=\"Smash Ballon is the best blogging tool for adding social media feeds.\" class=\"wp-image-163410\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-smashballoon.png 700w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-smashballoon-300x183.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-smashballoon-600x366.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-smashballoon-98x60.png 98w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-smashballoon-148x90.png 148w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://smashballoon.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Smash Balloon\">Smash Balloon</a> is a powerful plugin featuring a set of social media feed plugins that let you easily bring your Facebook, Instagram, Twitter, or YouTube updates onto your website. It’s a great tool to boost engagement and social media following.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Smash Balloon’s suite of social media plugins lets you embed your social media posts on your site, enabling users to interact with them. And if you sell products on Instagram, you can even create shoppable feeds to boost your sales.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Pricing</strong>: $49/year for a single social media feed plugin. The all-access bundle costs $239.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-10-ahrefs\">10. <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/recommends/ahrefs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"Ahrefs\">Ahrefs</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/recommends/ahrefs/\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"345\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-diy-seo-software-tools-ahrefs.png\" alt=\"Ahrefs is a powerful all-in-one marketing tool.\" class=\"wp-image-163411\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-diy-seo-software-tools-ahrefs.png 700w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-diy-seo-software-tools-ahrefs-300x148.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-diy-seo-software-tools-ahrefs-600x296.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-diy-seo-software-tools-ahrefs-122x60.png 122w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-diy-seo-software-tools-ahrefs-183x90.png 183w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/recommends/ahrefs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"Ahrefs\">Ahrefs</a> is a comprehensive marketing and SEO toolkit to help you DIY your SEO as a blogger. It also has powerful keyword research and competitor analysis tools.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can use Ahrefs for keyword discovery, uncovering backlink opportunities, rank tracking, and more. You can use this data to develop impactful SEO strategies to help you outperform your competitors.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Another noteworthy feature you’ll love in Ahrefs is the Content Explorer. This tool shows you the most popular content ranking for a particular keyword. You can use it to reverse engineer the SEO strategy behind the winning articles.&nbsp;<strong>Pricing</strong>: Paid plans start at $99.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-10-semrush\">11. <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/recommends/semrush/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"Semrush\">Semrush</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/recommends/semrush/\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"702\" height=\"425\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-semrush.png\" alt=\"Semrush is the best all-in-one marketing tool.\" class=\"wp-image-163413\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-semrush.png 702w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-semrush-300x182.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-semrush-600x363.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-semrush-99x60.png 99w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-semrush-149x90.png 149w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 702px) 100vw, 702px\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/recommends/semrush/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"Semrush\">Semrush</a> is an all-in-one SEO and content marketing tool that helps you find competitive search data so your blog can rank high for the right keywords. It also gives you insights into your competitors’ strategies in display advertising, organic and paid search, and link building.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Semrush really shines when it comes to keyword research. One reason for this is that besides showing you search volumes and keyword difficulty, it also shows you the search intent behind your keywords. This helps ensure you use the right keywords and create content your readers will find helpful. And when writing your blog posts, you can use <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/recommends/semrush-seo-writing-assistant/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"Semrush Writing Assistant\">Semrush’s Writing Assistant</a> to help optimize your content.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Pricing</strong>: Paid plans start at $119.95. A free plan is available, but it’s very limited.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Best Semrush alternatives: <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/recommends/ahrefs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Ahrefs\">Ahrefs</a> and <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/recommends/mangools/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Mangools\">Mangools</a> suite of SEO tools.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-11-better-click-to-tweet\">12. <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/better-click-to-tweet/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"Better Click to Tweet\">Better Click to Tweet</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/better-click-to-tweet/\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"702\" height=\"310\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-better-click-to-tweet.png\" alt=\"Better Click to Tweet lets you add &quot;click to tweet&quot; buttons in your blog posts.\" class=\"wp-image-163414\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-better-click-to-tweet.png 702w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-better-click-to-tweet-300x132.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-better-click-to-tweet-600x265.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-better-click-to-tweet-136x60.png 136w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/best-blogging-tools-better-click-to-tweet-204x90.png 204w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 702px) 100vw, 702px\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/better-click-to-tweet/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"Better Click to Tweet\">Better Click to Tweet</a> is a free WordPress plugin that lets you insert ‘click to tweet’ buttons into your blog posts or other pages on your site. It makes it easy for your readers to quickly and easily tweet a quote from your content. This helps turn your readers into brand ambassadors, thereby increasing your reach.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The plugin has a special Gutenberg block, making it easy to use. Alternatively, you can use a shortcode to insert the ‘click to tweet’ button into your posts.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Pricing</strong>: Free.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-the-best-blogging-tools-to-help-you-grow-your-wordpress-blog-our-top-picks\">The Best Blogging Tools to Help You Grow Your WordPress Blog: Our Top Picks</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Our top pick for the best blogging tool to help you grow your WordPress blog is <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/pricing/\" title=\"Pricing\">AIOSEO</a>. It’s a powerful plugin that can help you improve your visibility on search engines. It also helps boost clickthrough rates and ensure your content is optimized for search engines and users.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you want a plugin to help you build a fast-loading website, then <a href=\"https://www.seedprod.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"SeedProd\">SeedProd</a> is it.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>We hope this post helped you find the best WordPress eCommerce plugin for your business. You may also want to check out other articles on our blog, like <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-start-a-small-business-blog/\" title=\"How to Start a Small Business Blog in 2023\">how to start a small business blog</a> or our tutorial on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-create-jump-links-in-wordpress/\" title=\"How to Create Jump Links in WordPress (and Increase Your Visibility On SERPs)\">creating jump links in WordPress</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you found this article helpful, then please subscribe to our <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/AIOSEO\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">YouTube Channel</a>. You’ll find many more helpful tutorials there. You can also follow us on <a href=\"https://twitter.com/aioseopack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">Twitter</a>, <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/aioseo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">LinkedIn</a>, or <a href=\"https://facebook.com/aioseopack/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">Facebook</a> to stay in the loop.&nbsp;</p>The post <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/best-blogging-tools/\">12 Blogging Tools to Help You Grow Your WordPress Blog</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com\">AIOSEO</a>.\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:36:\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\";a:1:{s:10:\"commentRss\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:44:\"https://aioseo.com/best-blogging-tools/feed/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:38:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\";a:1:{s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:1:\"0\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:7;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:97:\"\n		\n		\n					\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n\n					\n										\n					\n					\n			\n		\n		\n			\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:5:{s:0:\"\";a:7:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:54:\"What are Google Local Services Ads for Small Business?\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:118:\"https://aioseo.com/what-are-local-services-ads/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=what-are-local-services-ads\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:55:\"https://aioseo.com/what-are-local-services-ads/#respond\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Wed, 22 Feb 2023 14:46:00 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:9:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:4:\"Blog\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:8:\"SEO Tips\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:23:\"Google Business Profile\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:17:\"Google Guaranteed\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:25:\"Google Local Services Ads\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:15:\"Google Screened\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:6;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:9:\"local seo\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:7;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:18:\"Local Services Ads\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:8;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:16:\"Pay-per-Lead ads\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:28:\"https://aioseo.com/?p=162319\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:446:\"<p>Are you wondering what Local Services Ads are and how they can benefit small businesses? What are the requirements for using these ads? Should you take other marketing steps first? In this article, we&#8217;ll provide an overview of Local Services&#8230;</p>\nThe post <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/what-are-local-services-ads/\">What are Google Local Services Ads for Small Business?</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com\">AIOSEO</a>.\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:15:\"Sherrie Gossett\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31094:\"<p>Are you wondering what Local Services Ads are and how they can benefit small businesses?</p>\n\n\n\n<p>What are the requirements for using these ads? Should you take other marketing steps first?</p>\n\n\n\n<p>In this article, we&#8217;ll provide an overview of Local Services Ads and their benefits, and we&#8217;ll share some practical tips small business owners can take to boost their visibility in search engine results.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group aioseo-table-of-contents has-theme-info-background-color has-background\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<p>In This Article</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-aioseo-table-of-contents\"><ul><li><a href=\"#aioseo-google-local-services-ads-what-are-they\">Google Local Services Ads: What Are They?</a><ul></ul></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-googles-screening-and-verification-process\">Google&#8217;s Screening and Verification Process</a><ul></ul></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-set-up-your-local-seo\">Set Up Your Local SEO</a><ul></ul></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-get-started-with-google-local-services-ads\">Get Started With Local Services Ads</a><ul></ul></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-list-of-service-businesses-eligible-for-local-services-ads\">Businesses Eligible for Local Services Ads</a><ul></ul></li></ul></div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-google-local-services-ads-what-are-they\">Google Local Services Ads: What Are They?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Local Services Ads (LSA) are a Google ad product designed to generate leads for service-based businesses.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The ads feature the business name, a short description, and the average review rating plus total number of customer reviews.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Google&#8217;s goal is to deliver new leads that contact you directly through the ad, either by phone or by messaging you.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can opt to receive messages by email and to respond by email or SMS/text message. (The lead chooses the response method.)</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Google also runs background checks on its advertisers in order to provide consumers with confidence to engage with the business.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-be-seen-at-the-top-of-google\">Be Seen at the Top of Google</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>You&#8217;ve probably seen Local Services Ads. They appear in local search results for service providers, like plumbers, electricians, and real estate agents.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"669\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-serices-ads-electrician-1024x669.jpg\" alt=\"local services ads example\" class=\"wp-image-162322\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-serices-ads-electrician-1024x669.jpg 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-serices-ads-electrician-300x196.jpg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-serices-ads-electrician-768x502.jpg 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-serices-ads-electrician-1536x1004.jpg 1536w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-serices-ads-electrician-2048x1338.jpg 2048w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-serices-ads-electrician-600x392.jpg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-serices-ads-electrician-92x60.jpg 92w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-serices-ads-electrician-138x90.jpg 138w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>When you hover over an ad with your cursor, it expands in size.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>One benefit of the ads is you can be seen at the top of Google search results for related search queries. These Local Services Ads appear <em>above</em> the Local Pack.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Do note that ad ranking is related to the bidding process.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The ads are prominent and an effective way to connect with potential customers.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-pay-per-lead-pricing\">Pay-Per-Lead Pricing</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The pricing is unique: these are &#8220;pay-per-lead&#8221; search ads not pay-per-click (PPC) ads.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Pricing is based per lead and is a function of Google&#8217;s bidding process. You can opt to let Google automatically set your bid with a goal of getting the most leads per your budget. Or you can manually set the maximum you want to pay per lead.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you wind up with leads that you think are irrelevant, you can <a href=\"https://support.google.com/localservices/answer/7435486?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">dispute the charge</a> and Google will review it within a week.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>To get optimal results, Google recommends that you set a <strong>minimum budget</strong> of <strong>10 leads per week</strong>. You can use the <a href=\"https://ads.google.com/local-services-ads/cost/#!/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">cost estimate calculator</a> here to get a rough idea of the weekly budget.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-googles-screening-and-verification-process\">Google&#8217;s Screening and Verification Process</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>All businesses that participate in Local Services Ads are required to pass a background check. This includes a criminal background check for all owners and &#8220;field workers&#8221; (anyone who, on behalf of the business, will do on site work).</p>\n\n\n\n<p>For some types of businesses, anyone who interacts directly (including off-site) with customers will need to be screened.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Depending on local regulations, checks may also be done on business registration, license, and insurance. So if you are a roofer, financial planner, real estate agent, or other professional service provider whose state or province requires a license, you&#8217;ll need to obtain that before setting up a Local Ads account.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-what-is-the-google-screened-badge\">What is the Google Screened Badge?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Some professional services providers, such as real estate agents, are required to have their licenses checked. Their ads will appear with a green checkmark next to the phrase &#8220;Google Screened&#8221; to indicate they have passed this check.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"385\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-screened-local-services-ads-1024x385.jpg\" alt=\"local services ads google screened display\" class=\"wp-image-162325\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-screened-local-services-ads-1024x385.jpg 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-screened-local-services-ads-300x113.jpg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-screened-local-services-ads-768x289.jpg 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-screened-local-services-ads-1536x578.jpg 1536w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-screened-local-services-ads-2048x771.jpg 2048w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-screened-local-services-ads-600x226.jpg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-screened-local-services-ads-159x60.jpg 159w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-screened-local-services-ads-239x90.jpg 239w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-what-is-the-google-guarantee-badge\">What is the Google Guaranteed Badge?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>As you do your own searches for local services, you&#8217;ll notice that many of the ads have a green checkmark next to the phrase &#8220;<a href=\"https://support.google.com/localservices/answer/7549288?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">Google Guaranteed</a>.&#8221;</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/2-local-services-ads-google-guaranteed-1-1024x612.png\" alt=\"local services ads google guaranteed \" class=\"wp-image-162326\" width=\"518\" height=\"309\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/2-local-services-ads-google-guaranteed-1-1024x612.png 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/2-local-services-ads-google-guaranteed-1-300x179.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/2-local-services-ads-google-guaranteed-1-768x459.png 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/2-local-services-ads-google-guaranteed-1-1536x918.png 1536w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/2-local-services-ads-google-guaranteed-1-2048x1224.png 2048w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/2-local-services-ads-google-guaranteed-1-600x358.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/2-local-services-ads-google-guaranteed-1-100x60.png 100w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/2-local-services-ads-google-guaranteed-1-151x90.png 151w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 518px) 100vw, 518px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>This badge indicates the provider has passed the screening and verification process <em>and</em> their services are backed by Google. This means if consumers are unsatisfied with the service they can receive reimbursement directly from Google. There&#8217;s a lifetime cap on reimbursement. This amount varies from country to country. For example, in the U.S. the cap is $2,000.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>To receive the Google Guarantee badge, just fill out the Local Services Ads form and begin the background screening process.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-set-up-your-local-seo\">Set Up Your Local SEO</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>If you haven&#8217;t done so yet, be sure to set up local SEO on your websites. This is a low-cost process and it&#8217;s key for getting leads and sales.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>This is also a good time to start soliciting Google reviews, as these will show up on your ads.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>So how do you get started?</p>\n\n\n\n<p>WordPress users can use a plugin to get started with local SEO.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-step-1-download-the-all-in-one-seo-aioseo-plugin\">Step 1: Download the All in One SEO (AIOSEO) Plugin</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>We recommend that you download the <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/pricing/\">All in One SEO (AIOSEO) plugin</a>. This plugin has thousands of 5-star ratings on WordPress.org and it&#8217;s currently used by over 3 million people.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"485\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-1024x485.png\" alt=\"aioseo homepage\" class=\"wp-image-140989\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-1024x485.png 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-300x142.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-768x364.png 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-600x284.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-127x60.png 127w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-190x90.png 190w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage.png 1260w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Once you&#8217;ve<a href=\"https://aioseo.com/pricing/\"> downloaded</a> and<a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/installing-all-in-one-seo-pro/\"> installed the plugin</a>, you&#8217;re ready to get started.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-step-2-set-up-local-seo-basics\">Step 2: Set Up Local SEO Basics</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>In the top admin bar of your WordPress editor go to <strong>AIOSEO » Local SEO</strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"454\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-menu-1024x454.jpg\" alt=\"aioseo local seo\" class=\"wp-image-154766\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-menu-1024x454.jpg 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-menu-300x133.jpg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-menu-768x340.jpg 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-menu-1536x680.jpg 1536w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-menu-2048x907.jpg 2048w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-menu-600x266.jpg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-menu-135x60.jpg 135w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-menu-203x90.jpg 203w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Fill out the locations, opening hours, and maps info, and you&#8217;re done.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"478\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-settings-1024x478.png\" alt=\"aioseo local seo settings\" class=\"wp-image-154770\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-settings-1024x478.png 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-settings-300x140.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-settings-768x359.png 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-settings-600x280.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-settings-128x60.png 128w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-settings-193x90.png 193w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-local-seo-settings.png 1353w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-aioseo-theme-notice-box\" role=\"alert\">\n<p>You&#8217;ll need to generate a Google API Key in order to get your business to show up in Google Maps. Don&#8217;t worry, it&#8217;s very easy. Just follow <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/setting-up-google-maps/\">these instructions</a>.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p>This local SEO process adds code called &#8220;schema markup&#8221; to your website. This helps Google match your business to relevant search queries.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>And your business details will be added to its <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/what-is-google-knowledge-graph/\">Knowledge Graph</a>, a giant database of facts.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-step-3-create-a-google-my-business-account\">Step 3: Create a Google Business Profile</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Be sure to set up a Google Business Profile. This is a free business profile that displays your contact information and can include images, videos, and announcements.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>When people search for your business name, they&#8217;ll see this prominent display to the right of search engine results.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"588\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/5-google-business-profile-brasserie-blanc-1024x588.jpg\" alt=\"google business profile brasserie blanc\" class=\"wp-image-162331\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/5-google-business-profile-brasserie-blanc-1024x588.jpg 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/5-google-business-profile-brasserie-blanc-300x172.jpg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/5-google-business-profile-brasserie-blanc-768x441.jpg 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/5-google-business-profile-brasserie-blanc-600x344.jpg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/5-google-business-profile-brasserie-blanc-105x60.jpg 105w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/5-google-business-profile-brasserie-blanc-157x90.jpg 157w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/5-google-business-profile-brasserie-blanc.jpg 1371w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Your profile information will also appear in Google Maps searches and in the Local Pack.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Once you have some reviews, continue to <strong>solicit more reviews</strong> as you gain new customers. Your overall number of reviews will display in Local Services Ads.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-aioseo-theme-notice-box\" role=\"alert\">\n<p>Google Business Profile was formerly called Google My Business.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-step-4-get-local-seo-citations\">Step 4: Get Local SEO Citations</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Follow our <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-get-local-seo-citations/\">easy instructions</a> for getting listings in business directories and data aggregators.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>This step will improve your visibility in search engine results, and may boost your rankings.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-get-started-with-google-local-services-ads\">Get Started With Google Local Services Ads</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Getting started with Google&#8217;s Local Service Ads is very easy. It only takes minutes. You have 2 options.</p>\n\n\n\n<ol>\n<li>Fill out their online form.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Call their number. (They boast a wait time of less than 30 seconds.)</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<p>For this tutorial, we&#8217;ll walk you through the form. It should only take you a few minutes to fill out.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-check-eligibility\">Check Eligibility</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>In the first step, you&#8217;ll be asked to fill in your location and choose your service from a drop-down menu.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Wondering what services are eligible? Check out our complete <a href=\"http://aioseo.com/what-are-local-services-ads#aioseo-list-of-service-businesses-eligible-for-local-services-ads\" title=\"\">list below</a>. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-eligibility-1024x658.png\" alt=\"local services ads eligibility list\" class=\"wp-image-162332\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-eligibility-1024x658.png 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-eligibility-300x193.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-eligibility-768x494.png 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-eligibility-1536x987.png 1536w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-eligibility-2048x1316.png 2048w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-eligibility-600x386.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-eligibility-93x60.png 93w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-eligibility-140x90.png 140w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-create-an-account\">Create an Account</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>If your service is eligible, the form will ask you to create a Gmail address (or choose one you already use) to associate with your Local Services Ads account.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-add-business-details\">Add Business Details</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>In the 3rd step you&#8217;ll fill out a form with your business details, such as:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Name of business owner(s)</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Phone number</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Number of field workers</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Whether or not you have a physical location customers can visit.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-details-1024x658.jpg\" alt=\"local services ads business details form\" class=\"wp-image-162333\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-details-1024x658.jpg 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-details-300x193.jpg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-details-768x493.jpg 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-details-1536x987.jpg 1536w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-details-2048x1315.jpg 2048w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-details-600x385.jpg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-details-93x60.jpg 93w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-details-140x90.jpg 140w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-set-up-your-service-area\">Set Up Your Service Area</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>In this step you&#8217;ll set up your service area, by typing in the names of towns you service. Searchers in these areas will see your ads.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-service-ads-service-area-1024x658.jpg\" alt=\"local services ads service area setup\" class=\"wp-image-162334\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-service-ads-service-area-1024x658.jpg 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-service-ads-service-area-300x193.jpg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-service-ads-service-area-768x494.jpg 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-service-ads-service-area-1536x987.jpg 1536w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-service-ads-service-area-2048x1316.jpg 2048w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-service-ads-service-area-600x386.jpg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-service-ads-service-area-93x60.jpg 93w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-service-ads-service-area-140x90.jpg 140w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>There&#8217;s also an optional &#8220;Exclude these service areas&#8221; form field. Here you can type in the names of nearby towns that you don&#8217;t service.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-select-specific-services-you-offer\">Select Specific Services You Offer</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>In this step you&#8217;ll tick boxes for relevant services you offer. For example, if you chose &#8220;snow removal&#8221; as your service, in this particular step you&#8217;ll have the option to tick:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Salt sand and de-icing</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Commercial snow removal</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Snow relocation</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Residential shoveling blowing</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Residential plowing</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Other</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"671\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-service-types-1024x671.jpg\" alt=\"local services ads services details form\" class=\"wp-image-162335\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-service-types-1024x671.jpg 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-service-types-300x197.jpg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-service-types-768x504.jpg 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-service-types-1536x1007.jpg 1536w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-service-types-2048x1343.jpg 2048w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-service-types-600x393.jpg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-service-types-92x60.jpg 92w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-service-types-137x90.jpg 137w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-set-your-business-hours\">Set Your Business Hours</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Next, you&#8217;ll set your business hours.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"626\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-hours-1024x626.jpg\" alt=\"local services ads business hours form\" class=\"wp-image-162336\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-hours-1024x626.jpg 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-hours-300x183.jpg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-hours-768x469.jpg 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-hours-1536x938.jpg 1536w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-hours-2048x1251.jpg 2048w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-hours-600x367.jpg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-hours-98x60.jpg 98w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-hours-147x90.jpg 147w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-preview-your-ad\">Preview Your Ad</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>In the final step you&#8217;ll preview your ad and agree to Google&#8217;s &#8220;onboarding terms.&#8221;</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-whats-next\">What Happens Next?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Google will verify your business and licenses (if relevant).</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"531\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-verification-1024x531.png\" alt=\"local services ads business verification progress bar\" class=\"wp-image-162337\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-verification-1024x531.png 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-verification-300x156.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-verification-768x398.png 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-verification-600x311.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-verification-116x60.png 116w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-verification-174x90.png 174w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-services-ads-business-verification.png 1288w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Once Google contacts you to let you know the verification is complete, you&#8217;ll set your ad budget.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Check out their <a href=\"blank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">cost calculator here</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-list-of-service-businesses-eligible-for-local-services-ads\">List of Service Businesses Eligible for Local Services Ads</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The following services are eligible for Google Local Services Ads. You&#8217;ll notice that many of them are home services, but there are exceptions, as with beauty school, acupuncture, and financial planning.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Acupuncture</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Animal rescue services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Appliance repair</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Beauty school</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Carpentry</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Carpet cleaner</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Child care services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Countertop services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Dance instruction</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Dentistry</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Driving instruction</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Electrical</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Fencing</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Financial planning</li>\n\n\n\n<li>First aid training</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Flooring</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Foundations</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Funeral services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Garage door</li>\n\n\n\n<li>General contracting</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Handyman</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Home inspection</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Home security services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Home theater services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>House cleaning</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Hvac</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Junk removal</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Landscaping</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Language instruction</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Law</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Lawn Care</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Locksmith</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Massage school</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Moving</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Personal training</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pest control</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pet adoption services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pet boarding</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pet grooming</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pet training</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Plumbing</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pool cleaning</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pool contractor</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Preschool</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Real estate</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Roofing</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sewage system services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Siding</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Snow removal services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tax services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tree services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tutoring</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Veterinary services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Water damage services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Weight loss services</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Window cleaning</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-local-services-ads-faqs\">Local Services Ads Q&amp;A</h2>\n\n\n\n<div data-schema-only=\"false\" class=\"wp-block-aioseo-faq\" id=\"aioseo-do-you-need-a-website-to-use-local-services-ads\"><h3 class=\"aioseo-faq-block-question\">Do you need a website to use Local Services Ads?</h3><div class=\"aioseo-faq-block-answer\">\n<p>No, you do not need a website to start running Local Services Ads. For those starting a simple business quickly, such as house cleaners or snow plowers, being able to get leads quickly can help you earn revenue while you&#8217;re setting up other aspects of your business.</p>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div data-schema-only=\"false\" class=\"wp-block-aioseo-faq\" id=\"aioseo-what-was-the-garage-door-ads-scam-about\"><h3 class=\"aioseo-faq-block-question\">What was the garage door ads scam about?</h3><div class=\"aioseo-faq-block-answer\">\n<p>After Local Services Ads launched, some garage door repair businesses started manipulating the system by appearing to exist as more than one company. In this scheme, the business would buy dozens of other domains, all purporting to be garage door repair services, buy fake reviews, and buy ads. The goal was to completely dominate Local Services Ads by competing against themselves.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>As the <em>Dallas Morning News</em> <a href=\"https://www.dallasnews.com/news/watchdog/2017/10/19/google-kills-hundreds-of-ads-by-worst-garage-door-company-in-the-nation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">reported</a>, one outfit allegedly engaged in this scheme &#8220;poached&#8221; the names of real businesses. Google removed the ads and advertiser accounts. According to industry reports, instances of abuse of the ad platform <a href=\"https://searchengineland.com/google-local-services-ads-arbitrage-387645\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">still occur</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Google says they take &#8220;swift action&#8221; against ad manipulation. Use <a href=\"https://support.google.com/localservices/answer/9008912?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">this form</a> to report ad platform abuse.</p>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-summing-it-up\">Local Service Ads: Wrap Up</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Local Ads Services are a unique lead generation tool for small businesses. Success in digital marketing often requires experimentation, so you won&#8217;t know how well this works for you until you try it.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Some tips for success:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Be prepared to respond quickly to leads, whether they come in via phone calls or through email.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Have a sales process. This can be as simple as some talking points about your service and for overcoming objections.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tap Google&#8217;s ad staff if you need assistance.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Don&#8217;t neglect the optimization of your own website.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-whats-next\">What’s Next?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>We hope this post helped you learn what Local Services Ads are and how they might benefit your local business.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can also check out our article <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/what-is-nap-in-seo/\">What is NAP in SEO?</a> and <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/what-are-serps/\">What are SERPs (and Why are They Important For SEO)?</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you found this article helpful, then please subscribe to our <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/AIOSEO\">YouTube Channel</a>. You’ll find many more helpful tutorials there. You can also follow us on <a href=\"https://twitter.com/aioseopack\">Twitter</a>, <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/aioseo/\">LinkedIn</a>, or <a href=\"https://facebook.com/aioseopack/\">Facebook</a> to stay in the loop.</p>The post <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/what-are-local-services-ads/\">What are Google Local Services Ads for Small Business?</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com\">AIOSEO</a>.\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:36:\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\";a:1:{s:10:\"commentRss\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:52:\"https://aioseo.com/what-are-local-services-ads/feed/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:38:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\";a:1:{s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:1:\"0\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:8;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:85:\"\n		\n		\n					\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n\n					\n										\n					\n					\n			\n		\n		\n			\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:5:{s:0:\"\";a:7:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:44:\"How to Easily Embed Google Maps in WordPress\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:138:\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-embed-google-maps-in-wordpress/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=how-to-embed-google-maps-in-wordpress\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:65:\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-embed-google-maps-in-wordpress/#respond\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Mon, 20 Feb 2023 13:17:01 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:5:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:4:\"Blog\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:8:\"SEO Tips\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:30:\"embed Google Maps in WordPress\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:21:\"local business schema\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:9:\"local seo\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:28:\"https://aioseo.com/?p=152854\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:421:\"<p>Would you like to know how to embed Google maps in WordPress? Embedding a map with your business location makes it easy for your customers to identify where your business is situated. It also helps boost your local SEO. As&#8230;</p>\nThe post <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-embed-google-maps-in-wordpress/\">How to Easily Embed Google Maps in WordPress</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com\">AIOSEO</a>.\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:11:\"Kato Nkhoma\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:19733:\"<p>Would you like to know how to embed Google maps in WordPress?</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Embedding a map with your business location makes it easy for your customers to identify where your business is situated. It also helps boost your local SEO. As a result, you can drive more foot traffic from the web.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>In this article, we’ll show you how to embed Google Maps in WordPress easily.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group aioseo-table-of-contents has-theme-info-background-color has-background\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<p>In This Article</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-aioseo-table-of-contents\"><ul><li><a href=\"#aioseo-why-should-you-add-google-maps-to-wordpress\">Why Should You Add Google Maps to WordPress?</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-how-to-embed-google-maps-in-wordpress\">How to Embed Google Maps in WordPress</a><ul><li><a href=\"#aioseo-step-1-install-all-in-one-seo-aioseo\">Step 1. Install All In One SEO (AIOSEO)</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-step-2-add-your-locations\">Step 2: Add Your Location(s)</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-step-3-generate-and-add-a-google-maps-api-key\">Step 3: Generate and Add a Google Maps API Key</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-step-4-configure-your-google-maps-settings\">Step 4: Configure Your Google Maps Settings</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-step-5-display-google-maps-in-wordpress\">Step 5: Display Google Maps in WordPress</a><ul></ul></li></ul></li></ul></div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-why-should-you-add-google-maps-to-wordpress\">Why Should You Add Google Maps to WordPress?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Google Maps is the most popular navigation app on all platforms. This means if you run a brick-and-mortar business, then adding Google Maps to your WordPress website makes it easy for users to locate your business quickly. This helps you attract more customers, leading to increased sales.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>That’s not all! Embedding Google Maps into your WordPress site can also help improve your local SEO. According to research, <a href=\"https://optinmonster.com/seo-statistics/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"\">46% of all searches</a> are local, and embedding Google Maps into your WordPress site helps boost your online and physical visibility.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-how-to-embed-google-maps-in-wordpress\">How to Embed Google Maps in WordPress</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Ready to embed Google Maps to your WordPress site and drive more online and offline traffic to your business?</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Let’s dive right in!</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-step-1-install-all-in-one-seo-aioseo\">Step 1. Install All In One SEO (AIOSEO)</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The first step to embedding Google Maps in WordPress is to install a powerful SEO plugin like <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/pricing/\" title=\"Pricing\">AIOSEO</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"311\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo.png\" alt=\"aioseo homepae\" class=\"wp-image-151544\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo.png 700w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-300x133.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/aioseo-600x267.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/pricing/\" title=\"Pricing\">AIOSEO</a> is the best WordPress SEO plugin on the market. It is trusted by over 3 million savvy website owners and marketers to help them dominate <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/what-are-serps/\" title=\"What Are SERPs (And Why Are they Important to SEO)?\">search engine results pages</a> (SERPs) and drive relevant traffic to their sites. This is because the plugin has many <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/features/\">powerful SEO features and modules</a> to help you optimize your website for search engines and users.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>One of the features many users rave about is the Local SEO module.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>This powerful module is designed to help you rank high for local searches. It helps you do that by making it easy to embed Google Maps into your site. And you don’t need technical or coding knowledge to do so.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>For step-by-step instructions on how to install AIOSEO, check out our <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/installing-all-in-one-seo-pro/\">installation guide</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-step-2-add-your-locations\">Step 2: Add Your Location(s)</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Once you’ve installed and activated AIOSEO, the next step to embedding Google maps is to add your location data. Again, this is super easy, whether you run a single or multiple-location business.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>To do that, go to the <strong>AIOSEO menu » Local SEO</strong>. This will open a page where you can input your location and business information.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"702\" height=\"182\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-business-schema-1.png\" alt=\"The Locations tab enables you to embed Google Maps in WordPress.\" class=\"wp-image-161578\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-business-schema-1.png 702w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-business-schema-1-300x78.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-business-schema-1-600x156.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-business-schema-1-190x49.png 190w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-business-schema-1-347x90.png 347w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 702px) 100vw, 702px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>One of the first things you’ll have to add is to indicate whether your business is a single or multiple-location business.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"702\" height=\"456\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-business-schema-multiple-locations.png\" alt=\"You can add multiple locations by switching a toggle.\" class=\"wp-image-161579\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-business-schema-multiple-locations.png 702w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-business-schema-multiple-locations-300x195.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-business-schema-multiple-locations-600x390.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-business-schema-multiple-locations-92x60.png 92w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-business-schema-multiple-locations-139x90.png 139w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 702px) 100vw, 702px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>If yours is a single-location business, leave the <strong>Multiple Locations</strong> toggle set to <strong>No</strong>.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can also choose whether you want your location information to be displayed as a:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Gutenberg Block</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Shortcode</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Widget</li>\n\n\n\n<li>PHP code</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-add-local-business-schema-in-wordpress/\" title=\"How to Add Local Business Schema in WordPress\">Check out this guide</a> for detailed instructions on adding your locations to your site’s schema.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-step-3-generate-and-add-a-google-maps-api-key\">Step 3: Generate and Add a Google Maps API Key</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>With your locations set, you can embed Google Maps into your WordPress site. You must first <a href=\"https://cloud.google.com/billing/docs/how-to/manage-billing-account\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">set up a Cloud Billing account</a>, and then generate a Google Maps API key. <strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you already have a Cloud Billing account, you can create your Google Maps API key by logging into the Google Maps platform using your Google account. Next, click the <strong>Get Started</strong> button. You will then see a popup with your API key.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"699\" height=\"446\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-goole-maps-api-key.png\" alt=\"To embed Google Maps in WordPress, you need to get an API key from Google.\" class=\"wp-image-161580\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-goole-maps-api-key.png 699w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-goole-maps-api-key-300x191.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-goole-maps-api-key-600x383.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-goole-maps-api-key-94x60.png 94w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-goole-maps-api-key-141x90.png 141w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 699px) 100vw, 699px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Copy this key, paste it into a text file, and keep it safe. Next, click on <strong>Go To Google Maps Platform</strong>. You’ll then be asked whether you <a href=\"https://cloud.google.com/blog/products/maps-platform/google-maps-platform-best-practices-restricting-api-keys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">want to protect your API key</a> by restricting it. Click on <strong>Maybe Later,</strong> then come back and configure your restriction settings.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>And that’s it! You’ve successfully created a Google Maps API key.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-step-4-configure-your-google-maps-settings\">Step 4: Configure Your Google Maps Settings</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Now you can embed your Google Maps location in WordPress with your Google Maps API key. To do so, go back to <strong>AIOSEO » Local SEO</strong> and click on the <strong>Maps</strong> tab.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"702\" height=\"349\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-business-schema-google-api.png\" alt=\"Enter the API key in the Maps section of the Local SEO menu.\" class=\"wp-image-161581\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-business-schema-google-api.png 702w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-business-schema-google-api-300x149.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-business-schema-google-api-600x298.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-business-schema-google-api-121x60.png 121w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/local-business-schema-google-api-181x90.png 181w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 702px) 100vw, 702px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Paste in the API key you generated from Google Maps. You’ll immediately see a preview of the map once you do that.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"702\" height=\"541\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-map-preview.png\" alt=\"Once you paste the API key, you’ll immediately see a preview of the map.\" class=\"wp-image-161582\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-map-preview.png 702w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-map-preview-300x231.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-map-preview-600x462.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-map-preview-78x60.png 78w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-map-preview-117x90.png 117w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 702px) 100vw, 702px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Next, you can scroll down to edit the map setting. Here you can configure your map settings and how you want your map to be displayed. With AIOSEO, you can embed Google Maps using a Gutenberg block, shortcode, widget, or PHP code.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"702\" height=\"582\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-map-settings.png\" alt=\"You can embed Google Maps using a Gutenberg block, shortcode, widget, or PHP code.\" class=\"wp-image-161583\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-map-settings.png 702w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-map-settings-300x249.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-map-settings-600x497.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-map-settings-72x60.png 72w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-map-settings-109x90.png 109w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 702px) 100vw, 702px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>You can also choose from different map styles and even add a custom marker to your map.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Once done, click the <strong>Save Changes</strong> button.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-step-5-display-google-maps-in-wordpress\">Step 5: Display Google Maps in WordPress</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>We’ve now reached the step you’ve been waiting for, displaying Google Maps on your site. You can do so on any <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/posts-vs-pages-in-wordpress/\">page or post</a> by simply editing it.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 id=\"aioseo-displaying-google-maps-using-a-gutenberg-block\">Displaying Google Maps Using a Gutenberg Block</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Once you’ve opened your page in editor mode, click the <strong>+</strong> button to add a block and select the <strong>AIOSEO Local – Map</strong> block.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"702\" height=\"440\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-local-map-block.png\" alt=\"You can display Google Maps as a block by adding an AIOSEO Local - Map.\" class=\"wp-image-161586\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-local-map-block.png 702w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-local-map-block-300x188.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-local-map-block-600x376.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-local-map-block-96x60.png 96w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-local-map-block-144x90.png 144w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 702px) 100vw, 702px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>AIOSEO will then automatically add Google Maps to the page.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"702\" height=\"561\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-local-map-in-post.png\" alt=\"Preview of Google Maps embedded in a post.\" class=\"wp-image-161587\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-local-map-in-post.png 702w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-local-map-in-post-300x240.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-local-map-in-post-600x479.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-local-map-in-post-75x60.png 75w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-local-map-in-post-113x90.png 113w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 702px) 100vw, 702px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>You can edit your map settings in the right sidebar of your page.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"702\" height=\"456\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-edit-map-settings.png\" alt=\"You can edit your map settings in the right sidebar of your page.\" class=\"wp-image-161588\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-edit-map-settings.png 702w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-edit-map-settings-300x195.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-edit-map-settings-600x390.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-edit-map-settings-92x60.png 92w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-edit-map-settings-139x90.png 139w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 702px) 100vw, 702px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>For instance, you can show labels and icons, add a custom marker, and edit the map’s width and height.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 id=\"aioseo-displaying-google-maps-using-a-widget\">Displaying Google Maps Using a Widget</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>You can also add Google Maps to your site’s widget section, like the sidebar or footer.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>To do that, head to your <strong>WordPress admin panel » Appearance » Widgets</strong>. Next, click the <strong>&#8220;+</strong>&#8221; button and add the <strong>AIOSEO Local – Map</strong> widget block where you’d like to display your location (main sidebar, header, footer, etc.).</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"702\" height=\"495\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-widget-2.png\" alt=\"You can also embed Google Maps in WordPress by using a widget.\" class=\"wp-image-161592\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-widget-2.png 702w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-widget-2-300x212.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-widget-2-600x423.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-widget-2-85x60.png 85w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-widget-2-128x90.png 128w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 702px) 100vw, 702px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Once you publish or update your page, your Google Maps location will be added to your chosen widget area.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"702\" height=\"367\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-final.png\" alt=\"Your Google Maps location will be embedded in your selected widget area when you publish your post.\" class=\"wp-image-161593\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-final.png 702w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-final-300x157.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-final-600x314.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-final-115x60.png 115w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/embed-google-maps-in-wordpress-final-172x90.png 172w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 702px) 100vw, 702px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>And that’s it!</p>\n\n\n\n<p>You’ve embedded Google Maps into your WordPress site.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>We hope this post helped you learn how to embed Google Maps into your WordPress site. You may also want to check out other articles on our blog, like <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-start-a-small-business-blog/\" title=\"How to Start a Small Business Blog in 2023\">how to start a small business blog</a> or our tutorial on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-create-jump-links-in-wordpress/\" title=\"How to Create Jump Links in WordPress (and Increase Your Visibility On SERPs)\">creating jump links in WordPress</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you found this article helpful, then please subscribe to our <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/AIOSEO\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">YouTube Channel</a>. You’ll find many more helpful tutorials there. You can also follow us on <a href=\"https://twitter.com/aioseopack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">Twitter</a>, <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/aioseo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">LinkedIn</a>, or <a href=\"https://facebook.com/aioseopack/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">Facebook</a> to stay in the loop.&nbsp;</p>The post <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-embed-google-maps-in-wordpress/\">How to Easily Embed Google Maps in WordPress</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com\">AIOSEO</a>.\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:36:\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\";a:1:{s:10:\"commentRss\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:62:\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-embed-google-maps-in-wordpress/feed/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:38:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\";a:1:{s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:1:\"0\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:9;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:88:\"\n		\n		\n					\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n\n					\n										\n					\n					\n			\n		\n		\n			\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:5:{s:0:\"\";a:7:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:56:\"Small Business SEO Scams: How to Detect and Avoid Them \";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:170:\"https://aioseo.com/small-business-seo-scams-how-to-detect-and-avoid-them/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=small-business-seo-scams-how-to-detect-and-avoid-them\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:82:\"https://aioseo.com/small-business-seo-scams-how-to-detect-and-avoid-them/#comments\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Thu, 16 Feb 2023 15:17:00 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:6:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:4:\"Blog\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:23:\"Digital marketing scams\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:8:\"SEO scam\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:12:\"SEO scammers\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:9:\"SEO scams\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:20:\"Small business scams\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:28:\"https://aioseo.com/?p=158326\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:468:\"<p>Would you like to know how to detect and avoid SEO scams? As a small business owner, you&#8217;ve probably already received unsolicited email pitching SEO services. And you may be wondering whether some of these offers are worth pursuing. In&#8230;</p>\nThe post <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/small-business-seo-scams-how-to-detect-and-avoid-them/\">Small Business SEO Scams: How to Detect and Avoid Them </a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com\">AIOSEO</a>.\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:15:\"Sherrie Gossett\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:29998:\"<p>Would you like to know how to detect and avoid SEO scams? As a small business owner, you&#8217;ve probably already received unsolicited email pitching SEO services.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>And you may be wondering whether some of these offers are worth pursuing.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>In this article, we&#8217;ll describe common SEO scams making the rounds and we&#8217;ll provide ways to detect and avoid them.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group aioseo-table-of-contents has-theme-info-background-color has-background\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<p>In This Article</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-aioseo-table-of-contents\"><ul><li><a href=\"#aioseo-what-is-seo\">What is SEO?</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-counterfeit-seo\">Counterfeit SEO</a></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-common-features-of-seo-scams\">Common Features of SEO Scams</a><ul><li><a href=\"#aioseo-big-brands-do-it-too\">Big Brands Do it Too</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-types-of-seo-scams\">Types of SEO Scams</a><ul></ul></li><li><a href=\"#aioseo-protect-yourself-from-seo-scams\">How to Protect Yourself From SEO Scams</a><ul></ul></li></ul></div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-what-is-seo\">What is SEO?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>SEO, or search engine optimization, is the art and science of creating quality online content and experiences that rank well, satisfy searchers, and meet website goals.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Improving SEO may include</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Boosting site loading speed</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Producing high-quality content</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Soliciting positive reviews.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>SEO, done well, is the foundation for acquiring readers, leads, conversions, and sales.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-counterfeit-seo\">Counterfeit SEO</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>SEO scammers, like money counterfeiters, can destabilize and undermine their targets.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Historically, currency counterfeiters were saboteurs, parlaying the fake for the real and leaving a trail of damage in their wake.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Similarly, SEO scammers can destroy your rankings, causing you to lose leads and sales.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The good news is, with some training, you can detect SEO scams. One of the best ways to do this is to understand how &#8220;real&#8221; SEO works.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>But first, let&#8217;s dive in and look at common features of SEO scams.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-common-features-of-seo-scams\">Common Features of SEO Scams</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Of all digital marketing scams, it seems SEO scams are the most prevalent.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Many SEO scams bear these hallmarks.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-they-arrive-via-cold-emails\">They Arrive via Cold Emails</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>SEO scams typically arrive as cold (i.e., unsolicited) emails offering SEO services.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>These emails often come from <strong>@gmail</strong> addresses, marking it hard to link the email to an actual business.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>If a business is listed, the website is generic and lists no owners, no staff, and often, no address.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-detail-masquerading-as-thoroughness\">Detail Masquerading as Thoroughness</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Often filled with technical details, these emails give the impression that the scammer has spent time carefully analyzing your site.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"954\" height=\"157\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/seo-scams-example-email.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-158966\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/seo-scams-example-email.png 954w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/seo-scams-example-email-300x49.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/seo-scams-example-email-768x126.png 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/seo-scams-example-email-600x99.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/seo-scams-example-email-190x31.png 190w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/seo-scams-example-email-547x90.png 547w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><em>Excerpt of an SEO scam email sent to a small business owner.</em></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>It’s certainly possible that a marketer may take time to analyze a site and send a cold email pitching their services.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>But more commonly, a copy/paste email is sent to everyone on a list and the sender has never looked at your website.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-scary-reports\">Scary Reports</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The cold email pitches often list numerous problems with your website.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Or they may use images of legitimate reporting tools, taken out of context. Typically these will show:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>A scary-looking &#8220;score.&#8221;</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Lots of red X&#8217;s or similar negative marks.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-recurring-monthly-fees\">Recurring Monthly Fees, Unnecessary Work</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Most cold emailers want to charge recurring fees for their services. While that&#8217;s a completely legitimate practice for professional SEO specialists, scammers want to do work for you that&#8217;s <em>unnecessary</em>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>For example, Francisco Villalobos, owner of Inner Strength Fitness in Manhattan, was pitched on specific SEO work that had recently been <em>completed</em> by a legitimate vendor. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/francisco-villalobos-inner-strength-fitness-nyc-1024x610.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-160563\" width=\"706\" height=\"420\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/francisco-villalobos-inner-strength-fitness-nyc-1024x610.jpg 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/francisco-villalobos-inner-strength-fitness-nyc-300x179.jpg 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/francisco-villalobos-inner-strength-fitness-nyc-768x458.jpg 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/francisco-villalobos-inner-strength-fitness-nyc-600x358.jpg 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/francisco-villalobos-inner-strength-fitness-nyc-101x60.jpg 101w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/francisco-villalobos-inner-strength-fitness-nyc-151x90.jpg 151w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/francisco-villalobos-inner-strength-fitness-nyc.jpg 1428w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 706px) 100vw, 706px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><em>Francisco Villalobos (at left), owner of Inner Strength Fitness, with a client.</em></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Within days, Villalobos received a similar pitch, from another emailer. This pitch made the same false claim about unnecessary work that urgently needed to be done.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-big-brands-do-it-too\">Big Brands Do it Too</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Unfortunately, big brands are not beneath sending out scammy emails too.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>As we&#8217;ll see below, a famous web hosting brand sent a ridiculous SEO email to their customers.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>So, are you ready for a quick tour of the most common SEO scams?</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-types-of-seo-scams\">Types of SEO Scams</h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-guaranteed-rankings\">SEO Scam #1: Guaranteed Rankings</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>The pitch</strong>: Get your site ranking on the first page of Google search results.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Often this pitch also provides a time frame. Here&#8217;s an actual example from an email.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"142\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/seo-scams-example-1-1024x142.png\" alt=\"seo scams example\" class=\"wp-image-158959\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/seo-scams-example-1-1024x142.png 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/seo-scams-example-1-300x42.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/seo-scams-example-1-768x106.png 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/seo-scams-example-1-600x83.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/seo-scams-example-1-190x26.png 190w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/seo-scams-example-1-649x90.png 649w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/seo-scams-example-1.png 1082w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What&#8217;s wrong with it?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>No one can guarantee Page 1 results.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Even Google can&#8217;t predict what will wind up on page 1 or <em>when</em>.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Web pages rank <em>in relation to</em> a keyword (search query). Not all search queries are worth ranking for. For example, we found a local electrician&#8217;s site ranked high for &#8220;halloween pumpkin LED lights.&#8221; We&#8217;re pretty sure that people searching for that keyword have no intent to hire an electrician.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-fake-google-lighthouse-report\">SEO Scam #2: Fake Google Lighthouse Report</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Background:</strong> Google Lighthouse is a web performance measurement tool, used by professionals, to gauge site loading speed, along with other metrics.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Site loading speed <em>is</em> an SEO ranking factor.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>The pitch</strong>: We ran a Google Lighthouse report for you and your site loading speed is poor. That&#8217;s bad for rankings. Call us for help!</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Special feature</strong>: The email includes an image of your very low speed score. The style of the image looks like it&#8217;s from the Google report, but it&#8217;s not.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What&#8217;s wrong with it:</strong> They never ran a report on your website. The speed score is made up.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Example</strong>: Our first encounter with this scam was an email from one of the world&#8217;s most famous web hosting companies. The email, (excerpted below), was sent to one of our colleagues. It states that the hosting company tested a website belonging to our colleague, and it scored a 7.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>(Since Google Lighthouse scores are out of 100, this means our site allegedly scored<strong> 7/100</strong>.)</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"943\" height=\"565\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/seo-scams-google-lighthouse-report.png\" alt=\"seo scam google lighthouse report\" class=\"wp-image-158951\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/seo-scams-google-lighthouse-report.png 943w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/seo-scams-google-lighthouse-report-300x180.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/seo-scams-google-lighthouse-report-768x460.png 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/seo-scams-google-lighthouse-report-600x359.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/seo-scams-google-lighthouse-report-100x60.png 100w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/seo-scams-google-lighthouse-report-150x90.png 150w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>In reality, the website has always scored a 100/100. Here&#8217;s the true website score, from Google Lighthouse.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"603\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-lighthouse-performance-1024x603.png\" alt=\"google lighthouse report\" class=\"wp-image-158952\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-lighthouse-performance-1024x603.png 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-lighthouse-performance-300x177.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-lighthouse-performance-768x452.png 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-lighthouse-performance-600x353.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-lighthouse-performance-102x60.png 102w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-lighthouse-performance-153x90.png 153w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/google-lighthouse-performance.png 1092w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>You can use the <a href=\"https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/lighthouse/blipmdconlkpinefehnmjammfjpmpbjk?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">Google Lighthouse Chrome extension</a> to see your score. But the speed (performance) score is the same as the one you can get from <a href=\"https://pagespeed.web.dev/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">Google PageSpeed Insights</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-backlinks-from-high-da-sites\">SEO Scam #3: Get Backlinks from High-DA Sites</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Link-building is a legitimate marketing tactic, but when &#8220;black hat&#8221; SEO techniques are used, it can destroy your rankings.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Background</strong>: Backlinks (links from other sites to yours) are a <strong>SEO ranking factor</strong>. Links from reputable websites can have a positive impact on your SEO. But backlinks from low-quality sites (such as financial scam sites) can ruin your SEO.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>DA stands for &#8220;Domain Authority.&#8221; While Google&#8217;s algorithms do not use domain authority scores, some professional marketing tools, like Moz, <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/recommends/semrush\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">Semrush</a>, and <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/recommends/ahrefs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">ahrefs</a> do. These scores, measured out of 100, on a logarithmic scale, are a proxy for measuring the quality of a website.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"241\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/domain-rating-ahrefs-1024x241.png\" alt=\"ahrefs domain rating example\" class=\"wp-image-158954\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/domain-rating-ahrefs-1024x241.png 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/domain-rating-ahrefs-300x71.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/domain-rating-ahrefs-768x181.png 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/domain-rating-ahrefs-600x141.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/domain-rating-ahrefs-190x45.png 190w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/domain-rating-ahrefs-383x90.png 383w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/domain-rating-ahrefs.png 1187w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><em>Ahrefs.com displays a Domain Rating (DR) of 91 for the University of Cambridge website. (“Domain Rating” is ahrefs’ version of a domain authority score.)</em></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>The pitch</strong>: See my price list of high-DA sites I can get you backlinks from. You can pay for a link to be placed on existing content or create a guest post to be published on one of these sites, and include a backlink to your own site.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The problems:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Paying for links</strong>, in order to boost rankings, is against Google&#8217;s guidelines. Google has gotten very good at detecting unnatural link patterns. Participating in these <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/search/docs/essentials/spam-policies#link-spam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">link schemes</a> can ruin your SEO.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>High-DA doesn&#8217;t always mean high-quality links</strong>. Some of these &#8216;marketers&#8217; buy domains that have expired, and already have a high DA score. Then, they turn it into a spam blog (also called a “splog”).</li>\n\n\n\n<li>A <strong>spam blog</strong> is a site that only exists to sell links. The quality of the content is usually terrible, and covers a weird mix of topics.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Often these &#8220;splogs&#8221; are part of <strong>PBNs</strong> &#8211; private blog networks. These are multiple spam blogs operated by the same people engaged in link schemes.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Money anchors: </strong>The choice of anchor text can also damage your SEO. Scammers and inexperienced marketers will often use <em>transactional keywords</em> (like &#8220;buy discounted wedding ring&#8221; ) when getting backlinks for you on other sites. When they do this repeatedly, it doesn&#8217;t help your SEO, it sends Google a red flag.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-guest-posts-free-content\">SEO Scam #4: Get Free Content</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>This scam is related to link-building. But in this case, the party contacting you is building links for <em>someone else&#8217;s site</em>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Exception</strong>: Guest posting to build links is a legitimate marketing technique. Let&#8217;s see how the scammy version of this differs from the beneficial version.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>The pitch</strong>: I&#8217;d like to provide a guest post for your website on topic X. Would you be interested?</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>The problem</strong>: No one is giving you free content without wanting something in return. The guest poster wants to include a link in the article to benefit their (or someone else&#8217;s) SEO.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>If that link goes to a PBN then your site may be seen as related to link schemes and be penalized by Google.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Avoid any offers that request links to questionable websites including online casinos or drug sites.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>When it&#8217;s legitimate: </strong>You may receive legitimate offers from individuals or companies for guest posts. Individuals may be wanting to establish their expertise by writing for other sites in their niche. They will likely want to include a link back to their website. Companies, particularly software companies, often budget for guest posts to be created for other sites in return for a link back to their site.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"392\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/guest-blogging-pitch-1024x392.png\" alt=\"legitimate guest post email\" class=\"wp-image-158955\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/guest-blogging-pitch-1024x392.png 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/guest-blogging-pitch-300x115.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/guest-blogging-pitch-768x294.png 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/guest-blogging-pitch-600x230.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/guest-blogging-pitch-157x60.png 157w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/guest-blogging-pitch-235x90.png 235w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/guest-blogging-pitch.png 1296w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><em>Thi</em>s<em> is an example of a legitimate guest blogging pitch. This one was from a software company. The email was signed with the full name of the marketer and the URL of the company.</em></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Things to keep in mind</strong> with legitimate guest posts: Allow 1 link, and no links to spurious websites. Only consider offers that may be of genuine use for your readers.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-fake-traffic\">SEO Scam #5: Fake Traffic</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Some marketers will try to sell you on boosting traffic. While some of these efforts may be legitimate, unscrupulous individuals may use bots to create an illusion of increased traffic.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Background</strong>: Not all bots are bad. For example, search engines and marketing tools rely on bots for data and analysis.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>The problem</strong>: Bots don&#8217;t sign up for newsletters, read articles, or buy things. So there&#8217;s no benefit to acquiring fake traffic.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Things to keep in mind</strong>: Traffic is not a key performance indicator (KPI), it&#8217;s a means to an end. While businesses may measure web traffic, it&#8217;s meaningful only when traffic increases are linked to increased sales. So while freelance or in-house marketers may measure traffic, businesses see revenue and sales as KPIs.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-calls-from-fake-google-employees\">SEO Scam #6: Calls from Fake Google Employees</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>The pitch</strong>: I work for Google and noticed that you have some problems with your business listings. Your NAP is not consistent. I can fix that for you for X dollars.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>The problem:</strong> No one from Google is going to call you about your <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/what-is-nap-in-seo/\">NAP or &#8220;business listings</a>.&#8221; As the call progresses, the person also mentions they work for a business. (One can&#8217;t be an employee of Google <em>and</em> an employee of a marketing business.)</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Keep in mind</strong>: Many top marketing agencies are &#8220;<strong>Google Partners</strong>.&#8221; This is different from being a Google employee. Google Partners are certified Google Ads specialists who’ve been vetted by Google and meet their <a href=\"https://www.google.com/partners/resourceshub/#requirements_overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">requirements</a>. To find out of a business really is a Google Partner search for the name in <a href=\"https://partnersdirectory.withgoogle.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" title=\"\">this directory</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Now that you&#8217;ve learned the most common types of scams, let&#8217;s look at a simple way you can become immune to SEO nonsense.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-protect-yourself-from-seo-scams\">Protect Yourself From SEO Scams</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>One of the main ways authorities teach others to detect counterfeit currency is to get them to study the real thing.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>This makes it much easier to detect counterfeits.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Similarly, teaching yourself <strong>SEO basics</strong> will help make you scam-proof and prevent you from over-paying for legitimate services.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Here are easy ways you can quickly pick up SEO fundamentals.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-start-using-the-all-in-one-seo-aioseo-plugin\">Start Using the All in One SEO (AIOSEO) plugin</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>If you&#8217;re a WordPress user, you&#8217;re in luck. SEO plugins provide a fast on-ramp to learning the basics, and you&#8217;ll learn by doing.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>For a beginner-friendly option, it&#8217;s hard to beat the <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/pricing/\">All-in-One SEO (AIOSEO) plugin</a>. The plugin is designed to be intuitive to use and requires no prior knowledge of SEO or code.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>It includes prompts and instructions so you can follow along right in the WordPress editor.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"485\" src=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-1024x485.png\" alt=\"aioseo homepage\" class=\"wp-image-140989\" srcset=\"https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-1024x485.png 1024w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-300x142.png 300w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-768x364.png 768w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-600x284.png 600w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-127x60.png 127w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage-190x90.png 190w, https://aioseo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/aioseo-homepage.png 1260w\" sizes=\"100vw\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>You can <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/pricing/\">download the plugin here</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Check out the <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/installing-all-in-one-seo-pro/\">installation guide here</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>All-in-One SEO (AIOSEO) is currently used on over 3 million sites and it has thousands of 5-star reviews on WordPress.org. Users include bloggers, small businesses, as well as large enterprises.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 id=\"aioseo-quick-start-guide-for-diy-seo\">Quick Start Guide for DIY SEO</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Businesses should start with these easy tasks:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Learn what <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/local-business-seo-for-a-single-location/\">Local SEO</a> is and how to set it up in the AIOSEO plugin</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Learn what local SEO citations are and <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-get-local-seo-citations/\" title=\"\">how to get them</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>All users can follow this sequence:</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Week 1:</td><td>Learn what a title tag is and <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/seo-title-tags/\">how to optimize it</a>.</td></tr><tr><td>Week 2:</td><td>Learn what a meta description is and <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-write-meta-descriptions-for-seo/\">how to optimize it</a>.</td></tr><tr><td>Week 3:</td><td>Learn what alt tags are and how to <a href=\"https://www.wpbeginner.com/beginners-guide/image-alt-text-vs-image-title-in-wordpress-whats-the-difference/\">add them to </a><a href=\"https://www.wpbeginner.com/beginners-guide/image-alt-text-vs-image-title-in-wordpress-whats-the-difference/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"\">images</a>.</td></tr><tr><td>Week 4:</td><td>Learn what a target keyword (<a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/using-the-focus-keyphrase-to-analyze-your-content/\">focus keyphrase</a>) is and how to use it.</td></tr><tr><td>Week 5: </td><td>Learn what <a href=\"https://www.blogtyrant.com/how-to-easily-find-the-best-keywords/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"\">keyword research</a> is and how it can help your articles rank.</td></tr><tr><td>Week 6:</td><td>Learn what <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-add-rich-snippets-to-wordpress/\" title=\"\">rich snippets</a> are and how to add them to pages.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-follow-a-beginner-friendly-seo-blog-or-youtube-channel\">Follow a Beginner-Friendly SEO Blog or YouTube Channel</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Some SEO blogs are written for marketing professionals. Others, like the <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/blog/\">AIOSEO blog</a>, provide how-tos for beginners as well as content for those at intermediate levels.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The All-in-One SEO YouTube channel is another great source of easy-to-understand SEO content.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe title=\"How To Get Your Business To Show Up in Google Maps\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MUB316M3-7E?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe> \n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-what-seo-services-are-legitimate\">What SEO Services are Available?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Common SEO services offered by freelancers, marketing agencies, or SEO companies include:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Submitting sitemaps to <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/submitting-a-sitemap-to-google/https://aioseo.com/docs/submitting-a-sitemap-to-google/\">Google</a>, <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/submitting-a-sitemap-to-bing/\">Bing</a>, <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/submitting-a-sitemap-to-yandex/\">Yandex</a>, or Baidu.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/using-the-seo-analysis-tool/\">Site audits</a>: These reports detect what can be improved.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Creating a SEO strategy with measurable goals.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.blogtyrant.com/how-to-easily-find-the-best-keywords/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"\">Keyword research</a> and content creation.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Digital PR, which includes social media marketing, creation of high-quality content, and brand mentions in news media or industry association sites. (This is part of what&#8217;s called &#8220;off-page SEO.&#8221;)</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Conversion optimization which includes SEO elements.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Local SEO: this is SEO for local businesses with a <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/local-business-seo-for-a-single-location/\">single location</a> or <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/docs/local-business-seo-for-multiple-locations/\">multiple locations</a>.\n<ul>\n<li>It includes setting up a free Google Business Profile for you, getting local SEO citations and brand mentions, and encouraging customers to leave reviews.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Measuring your progress using tools like Semrush, ahrefs, Google Analytics, or Google Search Console.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"aioseo-whats-an-seo-campaign\">What&#8217;s an SEO campaign?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>An SEO campaign is simply a name for a planned set of SEO actions designed to accomplish specific goals.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-bonus-tips\">Bonus Tips</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SEO Industry</strong>: While a good SEO professional is worth every penny, there are novices with no experience passing themselves off as SEO experts. We consider pitches from incompetent individuals to be SEO scams too.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>SEO Agencies</strong>: Wondering what these are? They&#8217;re marketing agencies that specialize in SEO.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Conversions</strong>: Conversions (people who sign up for events, services, or products) go hand-in-hand with SEO. A good way to learn how to boost conversions on a WordPress site is to use the <a href=\"https://optinmonster.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"\">OptinMonster</a> plugin and grab some <a href=\"http://optinmonster.com/9-lead-magnets-to-increase-subscribers/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"\">lead magnet ideas</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"aioseo-conclusion\">Conclusion</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>We hope this article gave you an easy-to-understand survey of the most common SEO scams.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>You may also want to check out our article on the <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/best-wordpress-product-review-plugins/\">best product review plugins</a> and how to use <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/how-to-use-a-wordpress-faq-block-to-boost-seo-and-get-more-traffic/\">WordPress FAQ blocks</a> to snatch market share from your competitors.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you found this article helpful, then please subscribe to our <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/AIOSEO\">YouTube Channel</a>. You’ll find lots of helpful tutorials there. You can also follow us on <a href=\"https://twitter.com/aioseopack\">Twitter</a>, <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/aioseo/\">LinkedIn</a>, or <a href=\"https://facebook.com/aioseopack/\">Facebook</a> to stay in the loop.</p>The post <a href=\"https://aioseo.com/small-business-seo-scams-how-to-detect-and-avoid-them/\">Small Business SEO Scams: How to Detect and Avoid Them </a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://aioseo.com\">AIOSEO</a>.\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:36:\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\";a:1:{s:10:\"commentRss\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:78:\"https://aioseo.com/small-business-seo-scams-how-to-detect-and-avoid-them/feed/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:38:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\";a:1:{s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:1:\"2\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}}}s:27:\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\";a:1:{s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:3:{s:4:\"href\";s:24:\"https://aioseo.com/feed/\";s:3:\"rel\";s:4:\"sel