("1284","1","2020-07-09 01:42:04","2020-07-08 16:42:04","<div>当店スタッフ藤田（from Wisteria Guitars）による渾身のハンドメイドギター！！</div>\n<div>ビザールギターの奇抜なルックスとサウンド、実践的なプレイアビリティを兼ね備えた世界に一本だけのギターが小岩ファンクに・・。</div>\n<div>他の誰とも被ることのない一本が欲しい、ビザールは好きだけど材質や弾き心地が、、と行った方にオススメしたい一本です。</div>\n<div>フロントPUにはTeiscoのGold Foil、リアにはDeArmondのSilver Foilと両者ビザール好きには欠かせない当時物のピックアップを搭載することによりユニークかつ新しい発見のあるサウンドとなっております。</div>\n<div>当店にて展示、販売してお</div>\n<div>製作者本人による解説、その他作品が気になった方は下記リンクへ！</div>\n<a href=\"https://wisteriaguitars.blog.fc2.com/blog-entry-14.html\">https://wisteriaguitars.blog.fc2.com/blog-entry-14.html</a>\n<div>Body: <span class=\"st\">Curly Maple Top / 2piece </span><span class=\"st\">Honduras Mahogany Back\n</span></div>\n<div>Neck: Maple</div>\n<div>Fingerboard: Ebony</div>\n<div>Pickup: Teisco Gold Foil (Neck) / Rowe DeArmond Silver Foil (Bridge)</div>\n<div>Tuning Machines: GOTOH SE700</div>\n<div>Nut Material: 象牙<span class=\"st\"> (43mm Width ) ※画像はTUSQ\n</span></div>\n<div><span class=\"st\">Scale Length: 25\" (635mm)\n</span></div>\n<div><span class=\"st\">Fingerboard Radius: 12\"</span></div>\n<div>Fret Wire: JESCAR #55090 NS18%</div>\n<div>\n\nBridge: Rutters Chopped Bridge (Brass Saddles)\n<div class=\"gallery sevenspikes-cloudzoom-gallery\">\n<div class=\"picture-wrapper\">\n<div id=\"sevenspikes-cloud-zoom\" class=\"picture\" data-zoomwindowelementid=\"\" data-selectoroftheparentelementofthecloudzoomwindow=\"\" data-defaultimagecontainerselector=\".product-essential .gallery\" data-zoom-window-width=\"244\" data-zoom-window-height=\"257\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>Electronics: TOCOS Pot,CRL 3way Switch,Switchcraft Jack,Lenz Cloth Wire &amp; Cloth Wire Replica,Astron Type AM Capacitor</div>\n<div></div>","新品  Wisteria Guitars \"Natio-sonic\"","","inherit","closed","closed","","1272-autosave-v1","","","2020-07-09 01:42:04","2020-07-08 16:42:04","","1272","http://psynogroup.boo.jp/koiwafunk/1272-autosave-v1/","0","revision","","0"),
